# game/script2_2.rpyc:25
translate schinese main21_4a28e0f2:

    # ma "So? How's it feel seeing your old nemesis after all this time?"
    ma "怎么样？时隔这么久，见到你的老冤家感觉如何？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:26
translate schinese main21_8ba7bb37:

    # a "*Tsk* He's still the same performative douchebag he's always been. Though this is the first time I've seen him in his element."
    a "*啧*，他还是老样子，一副爱作秀的混蛋德行。不过，这倒是我第一次见他在这种场合游刃有余的样子。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:27
translate schinese main21_e8d0107f:

    # a "Don't trust anything these posturing, opulent fucks say."
    a "别信那些爱摆架子、挥金如土的混蛋说的任何鬼话。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:28
translate schinese main21_dee46150:

    # ma "You know all about posturing, opulent fucks, don't you?"
    ma "你对这种爱摆架子、挥金如土的混蛋可是很了解的吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:29
translate schinese main21_57ea5567:

    # a "...What's that supposed to mean?"
    a "……你这话什么意思？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:30
