    # ma "How inattentive do you think I am? You and Hugo went to the same school. Ergo, you're of the same ilk."
    ma "你以为我观察力有那么差吗？你和雨果可是同一所学校出来的。也就是说，你们是一路货色。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:31
translate schinese main21_5d4d5b91:

    # ma "Unless you want to try and convince me otherwise."
    ma "除非你想试着说服我，让我改变看法。"

