    # MC "It's the term we use to encompass all the sapient people of the world."
    MC "这是我们统称世界上所有智慧种族的说法。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:95
translate schinese main21_7c98d43e:

    # MC "So the humans, Elves, Beast-kin, Doomchildren etcetera..."
    MC "也就是人类、精灵、兽人、毁灭子民之类的……"

