# game/script2_2.rpyc:100
translate schinese main21_729e56dd:

    # MC "The DNA test I did two years ago said I had a zero-point-two percent chance of early-onset dementia."
    MC "我两年前做的基因检测说，我有百分之零点二的可能性得早发性痴呆。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:101
translate schinese main21_d4010794:

    # c "How early?"
    c "早到什么程度？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:102
translate schinese main21_7234fc9c:

    # MC "Uhh... it didn't {i}not{/i} say within the next six minutes."
    MC "呃……它可{i}没{/i}说是在接下来六分钟之内。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:105
translate schinese main21_61cf37b0:

    # c "Anyway, we call them \"Foundational Beings\" because they were all originally taught magic after its discovery... So they're like... the founders of the world as we know it..."
    c "总之，我们叫他们“基石存在”，是因为在魔法被发现之后，最早接受魔法传承的正是他们每一个种族……所以他们就像是……是我们所知这个世界的奠基者……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:106
translate schinese main21_bb46504a:

    # c "The word became bastardized after the discovery of Wild Elves, who had never been documented at the same time as the other races."
    c "在野生精灵被发现之后，这词就变味了——他们从来没有和其他种族在同一时间被记录下来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:107
translate schinese main21_89ff408b:

    # c "So now we just use it to refer to any of the sapient races. I still think the word \"Foundational\" doesn't really work anyway. I know it's about magic and culture, but shouldn't humans be foundational?"
    c "所以现在我们只用它来指代所有智慧种族。不过我始终觉得“基石”这个词不太对。我明白它指的是魔法和文化，但论奠基的话，不该是人类吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:108
translate schinese main21_b043cab2:

    # c "Seeing as the leading theory is that the other races evolved from us? We have the largest population by far, and crossbreeding never results in a human being born so... it makes sense that the other races are a later step in evolution, right?"
    c "毕竟主流理论认为其他种族是从我们这里演化出来的。我们的种群数量要多得多，而且混血也从来不会生出一个纯粹的人类……所以其他种族是演化中更晚的一步，这很合理，对吧？"

