translate schinese main21_26874f49:

    # MC "Did you see the guy next to Hugo?"
    MC "你看到雨果身边的那个家伙了吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:129
translate schinese main21_1288bf59:

    # c "Umm... a glimpse... he looked like a bodyguard."
    c "嗯……瞥了一眼……看起来像个保镖。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:130
translate schinese main21_157522b1:

    # MC "And?"
    MC "怎么样？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:131
translate schinese main21_5f3935e5:

    # c "And what?"
    c "什么然后？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:132
translate schinese main21_1a7ffa56:

    # MC "Oh, right... dull..."
    MC "噢，对……真没劲……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:135
translate schinese main21_23497482:

    # MC "His magic ain't right."
    MC "他的魔力不太对劲。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:136
translate schinese main21_726bc5ed:

    # MC "Like, {i}seriously{/i} fucked up. Just looking at him puts me at unease."
    MC "简直是{i}彻底{/i}出了问题。光是看着他，我就觉得心里发毛。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:137
translate schinese main21_e2f4cb04:

    # MC "I don't really know how to put it eloquently but... I can feel it at all times for starters. Someone needs to invoke their magic for it to be felt but... Either he's casting some kind of continuous spell or... it's {i}leaking{/i}."
    MC "我不太会用漂亮的词儿来形容，不过……首先，我能时刻感觉到它。通常魔力得在施展时才能被感知到，但他的……要么是在维持某种持续性的法术，要么就是……在向外{i}泄漏{/i}。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:138
translate schinese main21_c6d83891:

    # MC "Or maybe it's not even magic how we know it... like a different state of matter..."
    MC "又或者，那根本不是我们所熟知的魔力……就像是某种不同的物质状态……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:139
translate schinese main21_21094adf:

    # MC "And the other thing is that..."
    MC "还有一点就是……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:140
translate schinese main21_30d8943d:

    # MC "{b}It's huge{/b}."
    MC "{b}量级太惊人了{/b}。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:141
translate schinese main21_f139648a:

    # MC "It's completely monstrous. I feel like I'm being dwarfed."
    MC "简直是个怪物级别的存在。我觉得自己显得好渺小。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:142
translate schinese main21_a70107d9:

    # MC "Who the fuck is that guy?"
    MC "那家伙到底是谁？"

