# game/script2_2.rpyc:177
translate schinese main21_9a809370:

    # a "He owns this palace."
    a "这座宫殿是他的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:178
translate schinese main21_6a9585f0:

    # a "Don't know much more about him, other than that he's related to Hugo biologically. Uncle, if I'm not mistaken. Or great uncle, can't quite remember."
    a "除了他和雨果有血缘关系外，我对他的了解并不多。如果我没记错的话，应该是叔叔辈的。或者是叔祖父辈？记不太清了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:179
translate schinese main21_d0bc8e9b:

    # a "His name's Clement. That's about the limit of my knowledge. I have no idea what his stance is, how much he cares about Hugo, if he's just lending the palace."
    a "他叫克莱门特。关于他，我知道的也就这么多了。我不清楚他的立场，不知道他有多在乎雨果，也不确定他是不是仅仅把宫殿借给雨果用而已。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:180
translate schinese main21_d7fc1094:

    # a "I'm not worried about him."
    a "我并不担心他。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:183
translate schinese main21_4bf70d5a:

    # c "Does he um... does he seem like a normal person to you?"
    c "他……嗯……在你看来，他像个正常人吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:184
translate schinese main21_5e01f649:

    # a "I never spoke to him-"
    a "我从来没跟他交谈过——"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:185
translate schinese main21_448bb235:

    # c "*Groan*"
    c "*呻吟*"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:186
translate schinese main21_145e6d0c:

    # "The groan was pathetic, possibly the whine of a social battery that's being pushed to its limits."
    "那声呻吟听起来有些可怜，或许是社交精力耗尽边缘发出的哀鸣。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:187
translate schinese main21_d92b0e43:

    # c "Like... his magic... or something... does he seem like a normal person?"
    c "就是……他的魔法……或者别的什么……他看起来像个正常人吗？"

