    a "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2_2.rpyc:192
translate schinese main21_b232c8db:

    # a "I don't quite get it but... yeah? He's just another guy, right? I can't comment on his magic."
    a "我不太明白你的意思，不过……算是吧？他也就是个普通人，对吧？我没法评价他的魔法。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:194
translate schinese main21_feb3a915:

    # ma "He only really caught my eye for a moment, but I didn't pay him much attention."
    ma "他确实只引起了我一瞬间的注意，但我没怎么留意他。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:195
translate schinese main21_3a43ad46:

    # ma "Nothing out of the ordinary as far as I could tell."
    ma "依我看，没什么特别之处。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:198
translate schinese main21_e8b8d2e4:

    # c "O-okay, thank you. Sorry for bothering you."
    c "噢……好的，谢谢。抱歉打扰了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:204
translate schinese main21_25932415:

    # MCt "*Tsk* What if he is a bodyguard and he's just blasting out magic to make a show of it?"
    MCt "*啧*，万一他是个保镖，只是为了摆排场才大肆释放魔法呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:205
translate schinese main21_dbedb81e:

    # MCt "Or is he just abnormal? Resonant? What if he's the same as me?"
    MCt "又或者他只是个异类？“共鸣者”？万一他跟我一样呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:206
translate schinese main21_5a3f8fc5:

    # MCt "No one has commented on my magic unless I've shown it, though. But then it could go both ways, you need to be like me to detect it..."
    MCt "不过，除非我主动展示，否则没人会对我那魔法发表什么看法。不过情况也可能因人而异，得像我这样的人才能察觉到……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:207
translate schinese main21_be219d06:

    # MCt "I don't know where he is but... just a tingle... I can still feel his oppressive presence."
    MCt "我不知道他在哪儿，但……那种微妙的感应……我依然能感觉到他那股令人压抑的气息。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:208
translate schinese main21_6adbe4bf:

    # MCt "One thing I need to consider... and I don't know if this would be a blessing or a curse... is that if we're the same, or at least in the same boat..."
    MCt "有一点我必须考虑——不知道这究竟是福是祸——那就是，如果我们是同类，或者至少处境相同的话……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:209
translate schinese main21_6f7b0afe:

    # MCt "Then he would be seeing me as the same type of anomaly..."
    MCt "那么在他眼里，我恐怕也是某种同样的“异类”……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:210
translate schinese main21_72b18318:

    # MCt "And if he does... will he have answers?"
    MCt "而如果真是这样……他会有答案吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:216
translate schinese main21_05b5cf1f:

    # c "I don't want to talk to any more strangers tonight."
    c "今晚我不想再和任何陌生人说话了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:217
translate schinese main21_8be5913b:

    # MC "You can only talk to each stranger once anyway, then they're an acquaintance."
    MC "反正每个陌生人你也就只能聊一次，之后就算认识的人了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:218
translate schinese main21_ef60c58e:

    # c "I don't have the energy for acquaintances either..."
    c "我连去认识人的力气都没有……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:221
translate schinese main21_4c0ea15f:

    # c "Marcus and Ashley don't notice anything about that man you're obsessed with."
    c "马库斯和阿什莉可没注意到你痴迷上的那个男人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:222
translate schinese main21_09292a00:

    # MC "\"Obsessed\"? It's a fleeting infatuation at best."
    MC "“痴迷”？顶多算一时兴起罢了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:223
translate schinese main21_661f3c6e:

    # c "You keep telling yourself that."
    c "你一直在这么安慰自己。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:224
translate schinese main21_0ba033f2:

    # c "His name is Clement and he owns the palace. He's related in some way to Hugo."
    c "他叫克莱门特，这座宫殿是他的。他和雨果算是有点亲戚关系。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:225
translate schinese main21_2d204a49_14:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

