# game/script2_2.rpyc:255
translate schinese m21choice1_3_fc6a0271:

    # c "I wasn't... pushing myself..."
    c "我不是……在逼你……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:256
translate schinese m21choice1_3_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:262
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_a7b6047e:

    # g "This place is a god-damn maze. That's before you take the {i}actual maze{/i} they have into consideration."
    g "这地方简直就是个迷宫。这还没算上他们设的那个{i}真正的迷宫{/i}呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:263
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_f966b9db:

    # a "Ah, the scouting party is back."
    a "啊，侦察小队回来了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:264
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_cc41a9a8:

    # ch "This place is wild, dude. I feel like I'm in a movie right now."
    ch "这地方太绝了，伙计。感觉就像在拍电影一样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:265
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_e8950b56:

    # g "I don't even know if we have enough time to see everything."
    g "我都不知道时间够不够把这儿逛个遍。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:266
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_63e1206a:

    # ch "Seriously, they've got a ballroom, a fucking trading floor by the looks of it, I think I caught a glimpse at some people gambling through a doorway."
    ch "说真的，这儿有舞厅，看起来还有个交易大厅，我刚才透过门口好像还瞥见有人在赌博。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:267
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_d69b7621:

    # ch "Any of you guys know how to ride a horse?"
    ch "你们有谁会骑马吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:270
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_7d01286a:

    # ma "Can't ride a horse but I could eat one right about now. Where's the buffet at?"
    ma "我不会骑马，但我现在饿得能吃下一匹马。自助餐在哪儿？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:271
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_a94ec4c1:

    # a "Man, you're always hungry. You got a tapeworm to feed or something?"
    a "老兄，你总是饿。你是肚子里有条绦虫要喂吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:272
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_ecbbeeb4:

    # ma "The only tapeworm I'm tryna get rid of is Chase."
    ma "我唯一想甩掉的“绦虫”就是蔡斯。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:276
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_26e2a0cd:

    # ch "If you got rid of me, who would bring you the food?"
    ch "要是甩掉我，谁给你送吃的来？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:288
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_471d2aeb:

    # ch "I just knew you'd rag on me if I left the buffet empty-handed."
    ch "我就知道，如果我两手空空地从自助餐台回来，你肯定会数落我。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:289
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_fca8390a:

    # ch "It's fucking stacked. Like actually all-you-can-eat. Including you."
    ch "那儿的食物简直堆成山了。真的是“无限畅吃”。连你也算在内。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:300
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_10b7816a:

    # ma "Wanna explain why they're all sausages?"
    ma "能解释一下为什么全都是香肠吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:301
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_d802856f:

    # g "Throw one over here!"
    g "扔一根过来！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:304
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_1e2c6e72:

    # ch "I'm compensating."
    ch "我在做补偿。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:324
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_fb546986:

    # ch "[name] just had to come and sabotage our sausage fest."
    ch "[name]非得跑来搅了我们的“香肠派对”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:325
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_2fe02cf5:

    # MC "Damn, sorry for knowing what a woman is."
    MC "该死，抱歉啊，我居然知道女人是什么样子的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:326
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_7196772f:

    # MC "Wait, doesn't Ashley have a girlfriend?"
    MC "等等，阿什莉不是有女朋友吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:329
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_2127cd38:

    # a "And yet I didn't invite her. {i}Some of us{/i} don't feel like adhering to the bro-code."
    a "但我没叫她来。{i}有些人{/i}就是不想遵守什么“兄弟准则”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:330
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_e7d6d748:

    # MC "Which page was that on? I gave up reading it somewhere around \"thou shalt not use thine bro's foreskin as a foot warmer\"."
