    # c "That Clement guy... you're... worried about him, aren't you?"
    c "那个叫克莱门特的家伙……你……是在担心他吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:404
translate schinese m21afterchoice1_fb56de4a:

    # MC "That guy? ...Don't worry about it... it has nothing to do with you so just... let's help out Ashley then enjoy the party, okay?"
    MC "那家伙？……别担心了……这事儿跟你没关系，所以……我们还是先帮帮阿什莉，然后享受派对吧，好吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:405
