translate schinese m21afterchoice2_940e8a8c:

    # MC "What is it?"
    MC "什么事？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:458
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_b502fa74:

    # c "Is it... really okay for me to be here? You could've brought anyone, yet... me?"
    c "我待在这里……真的没问题吗？你本来可以带任何人来的，结果却带了我？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:459
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_730ab533:

    # c "I don't fit in here. I... don't fit in with {i}you{/i}, your friends. I can't talk to people, I'm just gonna sit back and watch everything happen."
    c "我跟这里格格不入。我……跟{i}你{/i}还有你的朋友们合不来。我不擅长跟人交际，我大概只会坐在一旁看着这一切发生。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:462
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_73ba2ec5:

    # MC "Well, first of all, I didn't choose you, Grace did."
    MC "嗯，首先，选你的人不是我，是格蕾丝。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:463
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_3fc63144:

    # MC "Second of all, I don't really care about that stuff. All of those things considered, I like you, so I'm not going to complain about spending time with you."
    MC "其次，我其实不在乎那些。综合来看，我喜欢你，所以我不会抱怨和你共度时光这件事。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:464
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_024f8c24:

    # MC "I just want to enjoy the night, and I don't see you getting in the way of that. In fact, {i}you're{/i} going to enjoy it with me."
    MC "我只想享受这个夜晚，而且我觉得你并不会妨碍这一点。其实，你会和我一起享受它的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:465
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_e91adff5:

    # c "I am?!"
    c "真的吗？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:466
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_590e8f39:

    # MC "Yep, we're stuck together for a little while and I'll be damned if I don't get some kind of enjoyment out of it."
    MC "是啊，我们还得待在一起好一阵子呢，我可不想白白浪费这段时间，总得找点乐子才行。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:467
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_b2ed384e:

    # MC "Also..."
    MC "还有……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:470
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_625b6b4a:

    # MC "You absolutely fit in."
    MC "你完全融入了这种氛围。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:471
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_b70042b0:

    # MC "You look like some... rich baron's daughter or something."
    MC "你看上去就像……某位富有的男爵千金之类的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:472
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_be6a5713:

    # c "N-no I don't... you're just saying that..."
    c "哪、哪有……你只是随口说说而已……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:473
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_e433654b:

    # MC "This is the best you've ever looked, and I can't even see your face right now."
    MC "这是你看起来最美的一次了，尽管我现在甚至看不清你的脸。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:474
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_d292bfef:

    # MC "You look great, Chloe. Seriously."
    MC "你看起来真棒，克洛伊。真的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:477
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_88352c4c:

    # MC "Did you choose that mask?"
    MC "那个面具是你选的吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:478
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_5f49d150:

    # c "...Yeah..."
    c "……嗯……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:479
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_d69f50da:

    # MC "Heh, I like it, the cat ears work great for you. Grace looks amazing too, like a femme fatale. She always dresses so casually, I had no idea she had such good taste."
    MC "嘿，我喜欢这个，猫耳造型很适合你。格蕾丝看起来也棒极了，简直像个致命尤物。她平时穿得那么随意，我真没想到她品味这么好。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:480
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_85e45c8b:

    # c "I chose her mask."
    c "她的面具是我挑的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:484
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_6614123a:

    # MC "You did?!"
    MC "是你挑的？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:485
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_d1a02b26:

    # c "Please stop pogging..." (multiple=2)
    c "拜托别摆出那副目瞪口呆的表情了……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2_2.rpyc:486
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_392881ac:

    # MC "I should've gotten you to choose mine. I've got the most generic-ass eye mask right here. I look like one of The Incredibles if The Incredibles was a boring isekai anime." (multiple=2)
    MC "早知道该让你帮我挑的。我戴的这个眼罩简直俗气透顶。看起来就像《超人总动员》里的角色——如果那是一部无聊的异世界动画的话。" (multiple=2)

# game/script2_2.rpyc:489
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_b09869fc:

    # MC "See, you're totally cut out for this. It's just a little bit of imposter syndrome."
    MC "你看，你完全适合干这个。这不过是有点“冒充者综合征”作祟罢了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:490
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_e30dc1fe:

    # MC "Didn't Grace say you did a little of your makeup as well?"
    MC "格蕾丝不是说你也自己化了一部分妆吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:491
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_117c46de:

    # c "I... did the lips... the eyes were a little too scary for me..."
    c "我……画了嘴唇……至于眼睛，对我来说有点太吓人了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:492
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_20bb5ef5:

    # MC "It's more than I could do."
    MC "换作是我，可做不到这些。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:493
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_00c4781b:

    # MC "Anyway, as I said, you look great. You fit in perfectly here."
    MC "总之，就像我说的，你看起来棒极了。你和这里简直是绝配。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:494
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_9878de6f:

    # MC "And I seriously can't get over how much I like the cat mask."
    MC "我真的太喜欢那个猫咪面具了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:495
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_b9e70863:

    # MC "Heh, I'm starting to think that with you and Cadence, I just naturally have a high affinity with cats."
    MC "嘿，我开始觉得，既然有你和凯登丝在，我天生就跟猫很有缘分呢。"

