    MC "你要是表现得友好点，给人的第一印象肯定比直接扑上来要好得多。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:538
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_49ea866b:

    # MC "I can't {i}un{/i}-shit my pants, you know. You gonna pay for the suit?"
    MC "我可没法把拉在裤子里的屎收回去啊。这套西装你赔吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:542
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_ded16676:

    # c "Ngh!"
    c "唔！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:548
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_0d36b562:

    # MC "..." (multiple=2)
    MC "……" (multiple=2)

