    # "{i}{u}Tiger{/u}{/i}" "Really?" (multiple=2)
    "{i}{u}老虎{/u}{/i}" "Rea真的吗？multiple=2)

# game/script2_2.rpyc:552
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_09b29044:

    # MC "Good news, Chloe. The tiger's friendly."
    MC "好消息，克洛伊。这只老虎很友好。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:564
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_74255a90:

    # c "W-wow... I can't believe it... a real tiger..."
    c "哇……真不敢相信……真的是只老虎……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:565
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_1304c135:

    # MC "I know right? It's insane that it's even here. These people are crazy."
    MC "是吧？这东西竟然出现在这里，简直不可思议。这些人真是疯了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:566
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_f36dc16c:

    # c "Do you think it's a pet?"
    c "你觉得那是宠物吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:567
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_cc2766eb:

    # MC "If it was a guard animal you'd be talking to me via Ouija board right now."
    MC "如果那是看门兽，你现在就得通过通灵板跟我说话了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:568
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_e297d3c7:

    # c "Fair point."
    c "说得有道理。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:571
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_8066792b:

    # MC "I guess a more pressing question is \"Why is it running loose around the palace?\""
    MC "不过，更紧迫的问题恐怕是：“它怎么会在宫殿里到处乱跑？”"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:572
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_5fceb36a:

    # c "Maybe it's entertainment?"
    c "也许是为了助兴？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:573
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_d2ead5ca:

    # MC "Could be. Owner lost sight of them for one second. You know how these tigers are, always running away. Goodness gracious, what are they like?"
    MC "有可能。主人只是一眨眼没看住——你也知道老虎这种动物，总是喜欢到处乱跑。天哪，它们到底是什么样的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:574
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_50dbcc0c:

    # c "Ehehe."
    c "嘿嘿。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:577
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_9b930df0:

    # c "Perhaps it came from that room."
    c "也许声音是从那个房间传来的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:584
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_4d9108ff:

    # MC "You mean the room with the doors that are swung wide open?"
    MC "你是说那间大门敞开的房间吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:585
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_26eefe0a:

    # c "Yes."
    c "对。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:586
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_aa587a80:

    # MC "The one with the enormous doorway that could fit a fully grown tiger?"
    MC "就是那个门口大得能让成年老虎钻进钻出的房间？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:587
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_26eefe0a_1:

    # c "Yes."
    c "对。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:588
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_c61b651c:

    # MC "The one with zero people standing by that would notice a tiger escaping?"
    MC "而且旁边连个能发现老虎逃跑的人都没有？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:589
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_26eefe0a_2:

    # c "Yes."
    c "对。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:593
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_7d0022a7:

    # MC "Holy shit..."
    MC "天哪……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:594
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_61fb3c30:

    # MC "You're literally Sherlock Holmes."
    MC "你简直就是夏洛克·福尔摩斯啊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:595
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_41c6e701:

    # MC "We made a deal, I do all the talking so, I'll go check ahead."
    MC "我们说好了由我来负责交涉，所以我先去前面看看。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:596
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_c96d991f:

    # MC "Just send me a text or something if you get your leg bitten off. I think I have band-aids in my storage."
    MC "要是你的腿被咬断了，记得发个短信什么的。我记得我的储物空间里有创可贴。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:599
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_4e0c4047:

    # c "What do you see?"
    c "你看到了什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:600
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:601
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_805cd45d:

    # MC "Another hallway, there are some more open doors, though. Big wooden ones."
    MC "又是条走廊，不过还有几扇敞开的门。是那种巨大的木制大门。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:602
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_94b8223c:

    # MCt "Mm... Clement is definitely in the main hall in the next room."
    MCt "嗯……克莱门特肯定就在隔壁的大厅里。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:603
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_6a1fa2af:

    # MCt "This feeling... God, it's like I'm being choked."
    MCt "这种感觉……天哪，简直就像被人扼住了喉咙。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:604
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_a578aafd:

    # MCt "I guess the best I can do is... nothing? Keep an eye on the situation."
    MCt "看来我能做的最好选择就是……什么都不做？先观察一下局势吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:605
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_a2b9139d:

    # MCt "There's no use in me tucking my tail between my legs."
    MCt "夹着尾巴逃跑也没什么用。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:611
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_8f7f286f:

    # MCt "And there it is."
    MCt "就是这儿了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:614
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_59dfb5c3:

    # MCt "One unconscious animal handler. One open cage, two open doors and..."
    MCt "一个昏迷不醒的驯兽师。一个敞开的笼子，两扇敞开的门，还有……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:615
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_319c50c7:

    # MCt "Zero tigers..."
    MCt "一只老虎都没有……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:616
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_39f8cffa:

    # MCt "Well, I can only assume this is the handler. Either he lost control in the festivities, or this is maybe some kind of sabotage to loose a tiger around the palace."
    MCt "嗯，我只能推测这就是那个驯兽师了。要么是他在庆典期间失控了，要么这可能是某种蓄意破坏，想把老虎放出来在宫殿里乱窜。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:617
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_b0ce0c4b:

    # MCt "Though, judging by the tiger's disposition, I doubt that would be a particularly effective plan from the hypothetical nefarious party."
    MCt "不过，从那只老虎的性情来看，我怀疑对于那个假想的幕后黑手来说，这算不上什么高明的计划。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:620
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_b4f889cf:

    # MCt "Conclusion:"
    MCt "结论："

# game/script2_2.rpyc:621
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_e02b8570:

    # MCt "Self-inflicted ailment."
    MCt "自作自受。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:622
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_a58b268c:

    # MCt "Time to get Chloe and the tiger, I hope they've made friends."
    MCt "该去找克洛伊和那只老虎了，希望她们已经成了朋友。"

