    MC "太神奇了，真不敢相信在你那凶猛的枕头攻势之后，它竟然还信任你！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:648
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_0f2f10e9:

    # c "It's so soft!"
    c "它好软啊！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:649
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_2d204a49_1:

