    MC "我不想扫兴，但是……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:660
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_6586b6a5:

    # MC "It may be behaving itself but do I need to remind you that it's a fucking tiger?"
    MC "虽然它现在表现得很乖，但我得提醒你，这可是只老虎啊！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:661
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_dc9bfb51:

    # MC "I'm questioning the wisdom of sharing a room with it let alone a cubic meter."
    MC "跟它共处一室都够让人怀疑这做法是否明智了，更别提挤在这么狭小的空间里了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:662
translate schinese m21afterchoice2_d073db3b:

    # MC "How did you end up straddling it anyway?"
    MC "你到底是怎么骑到它背上去的？"

