    MC "废话！要是我的作息跟个该死的监控摄像头一样，我也得累死！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1541
translate schinese m21choice5_2_955e97c6:

    # MC "But today's special because you're more makeup than eye-bags."
    MC "不过今天有点特别，因为你脸上的妆容比眼袋更显眼。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1544
translate schinese m21choice5_2_0201e5db:

    # MC "Let's go. I need your sleepy ass on photography duty."
    MC "走吧。我需要你这个睡眼惺忪的家伙负责拍照。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1545
translate schinese m21choice5_2_fcbc0b07:

    # MC "I thought about it a little more and you could also get shots of Hugo and any cohorts if it gives us any information we need."
    MC "我又琢磨了一下，如果你能拍到雨果和他的同伙，并且能从中获取我们需要的信息，那也不错。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1546
translate schinese m21choice5_2_7869d53d:

    # MC "Maybe photos of the palace in case any minor infiltration is needed or something."
    MC "也许需要几张宫殿的照片，以防万一需要进行某种程度的潜入之类的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1547
translate schinese m21choice5_2_81bae2bc:

    # c "You seriously don't plan on breaking into restricted areas, do you?"
    c "你该不会真的打算潜入禁区吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1548
translate schinese m21choice5_2_d53b5a45:

    # MC "Dunno yet, depends on if it becomes a necessity. You're going in any vents if that's how it ends up."
    MC "还不确定，得看情况是不是非得这么做。如果真到了那一步，你就得钻通风管道进去了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1589
translate schinese m21choice5_2_614670f1:

    # c "A-Amazing party so far, isn't it?!"
    c "这派对目前为止真是太棒了，不是吗？！"

