translate schinese m21choice5_2_7be8707a:

    # MC "*Pant* {i}I'm{/i} acting tough? What happened to {i}me doing all the talking{/i}?"
    MC "*喘息* {i}我{/i}在硬撑？说好{i}由我来交涉{/i}，结果我呢？"

