translate schinese m21choice5_2_2a03c1da:

    # MC "I need you to go ahead and get photos of Hugo and... well... Clement if necessary..."
    MC "我需要你去拍些照片——拍雨果的，还有……嗯……必要的话也拍拍克莱门特的……"

