translate schinese m21choice5_2_88797c51:

    # MC "No... only if he's instrumental to the whole Hugo situation. I promise it's not a personal vendetta."
    MC "不……只有当他与雨果那件事有关键关联时才拍。我保证这绝不是出于私人恩怨。"

