translate schinese m21choice5_2_8dc3f793:

    # MCt "If this is how the night starts... How on Earth is it going to end?"
    MCt "如果今晚是以这种方式开始的……那到底会以什么收场呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1742
translate schinese m21choice5_2_551689e3:

    # g "You've reached Oh-Eight-Hundred-GRACE. How can I help you today?"
    g "您好，这里是“0800-GRACE”服务热线。请问有什么可以帮您的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1743
translate schinese m21choice5_2_537f6e0b:

    # MC "Yeah, I have a complaint about one of your employees. I think her name was uh... B-Brace?"
    MC "是这样，我要投诉你们的一位员工。我想她的名字是……呃……B-布雷斯（Brace）？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1744
translate schinese m21choice5_2_13cb7d2f:

    # g "Uh-huh, I'm sorry to hear that, what are Brace's transgressions?"
    g "嗯……很抱歉听到这个消息，请问布雷斯有什么不当行为？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1745
translate schinese m21choice5_2_e134899d:

    # MC "She stole my fucking pop tart twelve years ago! I want it back!"
    MC "她十二年前偷了我那该死的Pop-Tart（果酱馅饼）！我要把它拿回来！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1746
translate schinese m21choice5_2_342416fa:

