    g "什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1755
translate schinese m21choice5_2_6d7015a5:

    # MC "Get off the stripper pole."
    MC "从钢管舞的杆子上下来吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1756
translate schinese m21choice5_2_56d622dd:

    # g "Bzzzt! Wrong guess, you have one more remaining. Would you like to use a lifeline?"
    g "哔——！猜错了，你还剩最后一次机会。要使用求助机会吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1757
translate schinese m21choice5_2_ae516316:

    # MC "Is there a lifeline where you tell me the answer?"
    MC "有没有那种直接告诉我答案的求助机会？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1758
translate schinese m21choice5_2_8028275b:

    # g "There is but it comes with a catch!"
    g "有是有，但有个附加条件！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1759
translate schinese m21choice5_2_5c46847f:

    # MC "...Go on..."
    MC "……继续说吧……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1760
translate schinese m21choice5_2_5f6b3ce8:

    # g "The catch is I get to call you a dumbass."
    g "条件是我可以骂你是蠢货。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1761
translate schinese m21choice5_2_96fbeb4e:

    # MC "Worth it to skip the shitty guessing game. Go ahead, I'll use that lifeline."
    MC "为了省去那该死的猜谜游戏，这很值。来吧，我用这个“求助机会”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1762
translate schinese m21choice5_2_cebcd549:

    # MC "So what are you doing that's gathering a crowd?"
    MC "那你到底在做什么，引得这么多人围观？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1771
translate schinese m21choice5_2_c1c4feea:

    # g "We found the pugilism ring!"
    g "我们找到了那个拳击擂台！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1772
translate schinese m21choice5_2_f41e2549:

    # MC "P-pugilism?"
    MC "拳……拳击？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1773
translate schinese m21choice5_2_e3f2d827:

    # g "Dumbass!"
    g "蠢货！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1774
translate schinese m21choice5_2_5c2fda34:

    # MC "You're fistfighting?!"
    MC "你在打拳击？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1775
translate schinese m21choice5_2_0f0be76c:

    # g "Uh-huh, unless you've got another definition of \"pugilism\" up your sleeve."
    g "没错，除非你对“拳击”这个词有什么别的定义。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1776
translate schinese m21choice5_2_7ebab010:

    # MC "Where the fuck did they set up a fight pit?"
    MC "他们到底把格斗场设在哪儿了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1777
translate schinese m21choice5_2_03e40239:

    # g "The church! If every sermon was like this I'd be a nun."
    g "教堂！要是每次布道都这么精彩，我早就去当修女了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1778
translate schinese m21choice5_2_f91e94c0:

    # MC "First a tiger, now a fight pit at church... is there anything rich people won't do?"
    MC "先是老虎，现在又是教堂里的格斗场……还有什么是这帮有钱人干不出来的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1781
translate schinese m21choice5_2_66137e50:

    # g "Tiger?"
    g "老虎？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1782
translate schinese m21choice5_2_aae0cc50:

    # MC "Yep, I'll tell you about it later."
    MC "对，回头再跟你细说。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1783
translate schinese m21choice5_2_c6299e37:

    # MC "How's the fight going? Are you winning?"
    MC "战况如何？你赢了吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1787
translate schinese m21choice5_2_fd7ea57c:

    # g "Take a guess."
    g "猜猜看。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1791
translate schinese m21choice6_1_87777e51:

    # MC "Judging by the whooshing sound that {i}wasn't{/i} followed by a meaty thud, I'd say you're not currently getting beaten to a pulp."
    MC "那声呼啸之后{i}并没有{/i}紧接着传来肉体撞击的闷响——我敢说你现在还没被打得鼻青脸肿。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1792
translate schinese m21choice6_1_81bef837:

    # MC "And judging by the fact that you're Grace, I'd say you're winning."
    MC "而且既然是你格蕾丝，那我敢说你肯定占了上风。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1793
translate schinese m21choice6_1_0fb5fb6a:

    # g "Ding ding ding! We have a winner!"
    g "叮叮叮！赢家诞生了！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1794
translate schinese m21choice6_1_254a5775:

    # MC "It's not your opponent, is it?"
    MC "赢家不是你的对手吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1795
translate schinese m21choice6_1_43eb13b2:

    # g "He wishes."
    g "他倒是想呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1799
translate schinese m21choice6_2_b188e696:

    # MC "You're not gonna win."
    MC "你赢不了的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1800
translate schinese m21choice6_2_62a34025:

    # g "What?! Why not? You're wrong, by the way, but I want to hear your reasoning."
    g "什么？！为什么？顺便说一句，你说错了，但我还是想听听你的理由。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1801
translate schinese m21choice6_2_080def47:

    # MC "You're on the phone."
    MC "你在打电话。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1802
translate schinese m21choice6_2_058211ed:

    # g "Who cares about that? It's just one of my arms. And if you put an end to your yapping, I'll get it back."
    g "那有什么关系？不过是一只手罢了。只要你闭上那张喋喋不休的嘴，我就能把它收回来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1809
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_9b820148:

    # g "Marcus is pretty good at this. Did you know that?"
    g "马库斯挺擅长这个的。你知道吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1810
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_19570c32:

    # MC "What?"
    MC "什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1815
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_cc6a9a52:

    # g "Yeah, he's kicking more ass than I am. Do you think he's got some kind of experience?" (multiple=2)
    g "是啊，他表现得比我还要猛。你觉得他是不是有什么实战经验？" (multiple=2)

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1816
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_9615578e:

    # "{i}{u}Grandma Helen{/u}{/i}" "Oof!" (multiple=2, who_ypos=1.0, what_ypos=0.45)
    "{i}{u}海伦奶奶{/u}{/i}" "Oof!" (mu噢！le=2, who_ypos=1.0, what_ypos=0.45)

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1817
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_c18c1cee:

    # MC "Hasn't mentioned anything like it."
    MC "他没提过这方面的事。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1818
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_9b627cd7:

    # g "He's fighting like it's his job. I'm glad it's not me standing opposite him. I mean, I'm good at dodging, and I hit hard..."
    g "他打起架来就像那是他的本职工作一样。幸好站在他对面的人不是我。我是说，我闪避功夫不错，出拳也重……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1819
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_fc3954dc:

    # g "But he knows what he's doing, I think he'd turn me into mince meat."
    g "但他是个行家，我觉得他能把我打成肉泥。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1820
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_aeae78e7:

    # MC "I'll remember that next time I'm tempted to piss him off."
    MC "下次我再想惹他生气时，我会记住这一点的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1821
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_3e840274:

    # MC "What about the mission?"
    MC "那任务呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1822
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_37ae9c83:

    # g "Marcus and I ain't found anything yet. Well, other than the fight pit."
    g "我和马库斯还没发现什么线索。呃，除了那个格斗场。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1823
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_5529cd7f:

    # MC "Okay, what about the other two?"
    MC "那另外两个人呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1824
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_516343a8:

    # g "We split up. So uh... I don't know."
    g "我们分头行动了。所以……呃……我也不清楚。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1825
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_6ba3f775:

    # MC "Wonderful. I'll call them instead. Thanks for all the help, if I didn't call you, I'd have no idea that I could also call Ashley."
    MC "太好了。那我直接联系他们吧。谢谢你的帮忙，要不是联系了你，我都不知道原来还能找阿什莉。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1828
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_3730d8ab:

    # g "Oh, there is one thing. I don't know if it's actually going to help in any way, but any little thing could help, right?"
    g "噢，还有一件事。不知道这到底有没有用，但哪怕是一点点线索也可能有帮助，对吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1829
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_5944010a:

    # g "We noticed two things, first, some of the more important restricted areas are locked by a keypad."
    g "我们注意到了两点：首先，一些比较重要的限制区域是用密码锁锁住的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1830
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_3fb92016:

    # MC "On the doors?"
    MC "是装在门上的那种锁吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1831
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_ce14252b:

    # g "Mmhm."
    g "嗯。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1832
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_8260b946:

    # g "And the other thing is that we saw a disgruntled member of staff. Might be able to get some information out of him if he's not feeling particularly respectful towards his bosses."
    g "还有一点，我们看到了一名心怀不满的员工。如果他对上司没什么好感的话，或许能从他那里套出些信息。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1833
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_ccdb9f6e:

    # MC "Would you be able to recognize him if you see him again?"
    MC "如果再见到他，你能认出他来吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1834
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_cb119a75:

    # g "Yep."
    g "对。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1835
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_0c69daab:

    # MC "Cool. Well, thanks for that, I'll catch up to you when Chloe and I are done spying on the rich kid."
    MC "好的。谢了，等我和克洛伊盯完那个富家子弟，再去找你。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1836
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_85e17c2a:

    # MC "See you!"
    MC "回见！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1839
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_0bdf12f0:

    # g "Always here to help!"
    g "随时乐意效劳！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1840
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_4ec79a26:

    # g "Bye bye!"
    g "再见！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1847
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_1436bc4d:

    # g "M'wah!"
    g "啵！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1853
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_0da1ef2e:

    # g "Okay, now where were we?"
    g "好了，我们刚才说到哪儿了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1910
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_dea66aa9:

    # a "'Sup?"
    a "嘿，怎么样？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1911
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_260de930:

    # MC "Having fun yet or is revenge still plaguing the mind?"
    MC "玩得开心吗？还是说复仇的念头依然萦绕心头？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1912
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_b2034140:

    # a "My brain always has revenge on tap. Remember that drink you owe me? Better pay up soon, you won't like me when I'm thirsty."
    a "我脑子里随时都惦记着复仇这档子事儿。还记得你欠我的那杯酒吗？最好快点请客，我口渴的时候你可不想惹我。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1913
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_46283d15:

    # MC "It was {i}one{/i} coursework question."
    MC "那不过是{i}一{/i}道课程作业题而已。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1914
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_1e956a51:

    # a "My rate is one drink per question, so what?"
    a "我的规矩就是答一题换一杯酒，怎么着？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1915
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_16984830:

    # MC "Answer the question."
    MC "回答问题。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1918
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_7c84f4c3:

    # a "*Tsk*"
    a "*啧*"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1919
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_49f1d110:

    # a "No, I'm not having fun."
    a "不，我并不觉得有趣。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1920
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_160d6ab6:

    # a "Regardless of my preoccupation, there's nothing here that would interest me."
    a "不管我是否心事重重，这里都没有什么能引起我的兴趣。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1921
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_a76256bd:

    # MC "Really? Nothing? I thought you seemed the type."
    MC "真的吗？什么都没有？我还以为你是那种人呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1922
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_a15cd04b:

    # a "What's that supposed to mean?"
    a "你这话是什么意思？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1923
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_a5eb6b7a:

    # MC "What? You wanna convince me that you won these invites in a lottery?"
    MC "怎么？你想让我相信这些邀请函是你抽奖赢来的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1924
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_02ab1f65:

    # a "Has Marcus been yapping?"
    a "是不是马库斯在那儿乱嚼舌根了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1925
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_ac6d0c52:

    # MC "Doesn't sound like you're denying it."
    MC "听起来你并不否认啊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1926
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_295cf4c1:

    # a "Have you found anything about Hugo or not?"
    a "你有没有查到关于雨果的消息？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1927
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_6dbe0d36:

    # MC "Wanna talk about it?"
    MC "想聊聊这事吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1928
translate schinese m21afterchoice6_6aaa820a:

    # a "No. Why do you care?"
    a "不想。你干嘛这么关心？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1932
translate schinese m21choice7_1_6f6ce723:

    # a "Good. It doesn't matter anyway."
    a "也好。反正也没什么大不了的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1938
translate schinese m21choice7_2_a47bb81f:

    # a "W-what? Why?"
    a "什、什么？为什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1939
translate schinese m21choice7_2_1cf77ca0:

    # a "What makes me so interesting?"
    a "我有什么特别引人注目的地方吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1940
translate schinese m21choice7_2_c88a1d5d:

    # MC "I dunno, you just are, the new mystery simply adds flavor."
    MC "不知道，你就是很有趣啊；这种新的神秘感更是增添了几分魅力。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1941
translate schinese m21choice7_2_c58b54c9:

    # a "W-whatever."
    a "随、随便你怎么说吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1945
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_5a209ada:

    # a "I'm in the food hall. Smells great, too bad I can't transmit smell over the phone."
    a "我在美食广场。这儿闻起来真香，可惜没法通过电话把气味传给你。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1946
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_d5b804e5:

    # MC "Are you sure? Is there a spell for that?"
    MC "你确定吗？有那种咒语吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1947
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_33e057a4:

    # a "I think it would be public knowledge by now if there was one."
    a "如果有的话，这事儿恐怕早就人尽皆知了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1951
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1952
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_e60914bc:

    # a "Did you just-"
    a "你刚才……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1953
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_015afe80:

    # MC "Do you smell that?"
    MC "你闻到了吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1954
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_f4956c3f:

    # a "Kill yourself."
    a "去死吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1955
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_c758030e:

    # MC "Anything interesting going on in the food hall? Is there a birthday cake?"
    MC "美食大厅那边有什么新鲜事吗？有生日蛋糕吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1957
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_2c8790aa:

    # a "Not yet. There will be. Apparently, he's cutting it as part of an event."
    a "暂时还没有，不过一会儿会有。听说他会在某个活动环节切蛋糕。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1958
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_0b2b52d7:

    # MC "Think we can use that?"
    MC "你觉得这事儿我们能用得上吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1959
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_87803bde:

    # a "Not sure yet. It's good to have in the back of your head."
    a "还不确定。不过先记在心里总没坏处。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1960
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_f5ffbb60:

    # MC "I'll remember it. Anything else."
    MC "我会记住的。还有别的吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1961
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_3951ab96:

    # a "Nope, I can't focus anyway. One of the guests is being super loud and obnoxious."
    a "不，反正我也没法集中注意力。有个客人吵得要命，特别讨人厌。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1962
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_9c2644b4:

    # a "I think he has Tourette's Syndrome."
    a "我觉得他可能患有妥瑞氏综合征。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1971
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_d482a13c:

    # khaled "Tell 'em to bring out the lobster!"
    khaled "叫他们把龙虾端上来！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1972
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_8cc000e5:

    # khaled "Haha! Call me pineapple!"
    khaled "哈哈！叫我“菠萝”！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1982
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_5e05c532:

    # MC "What's Chase up to."
    MC "蔡斯在干嘛？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1983
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_64e63d94:

    # a "\"Hang on. I need to go plant a bomb.\" Were his exact words."
    a "“等等，我得去安个炸弹。”——这是他的原话。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1986
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_1e02f7d0:

    # MC "W-wot?"
    MC "什……什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1987
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_843e7863:

    # MC "What the fuck is he doing?"
    MC "他到底在搞什么鬼？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1988
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_299e7107:

    # a "I dunno. Either you take it at face value and we're all going up in flames, or he's grabbed a banana peel and intends for Hugo to slip on it."
    a "我不知道。要么按字面意思理解，然后我们全都玩完；要么他只是拿了个香蕉皮，想让雨果踩上去滑一跤。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1989
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_26d12f72:

    # MC "R-right... a metaphorical bomb..."
    MC "没、没错……是个比喻意义上的炸弹……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1990
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_bae22fa2:

    # a "Nono, don't rule out the literal bomb."
    a "不不，别排除那种真正的炸弹。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1991
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_c7e9a148:

    # a "W-wait a second..."
    a "等、等一下……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1994
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_940e8a8c:

    # MC "What is it?"
    MC "什么事？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1995
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_a896556f:

    # a "Some woman's approaching me."
    a "有个女人正朝我走过来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1996
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_b718b528:

    # MC "Recognize her?"
    MC "认得她吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:1997
translate schinese m21afterchoice7_91e8abda:

    # a "We're all wearing masks, dude."
