    g "我们弄清楚了这些情况："

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3754
translate schinese m21rapwin_7bceca3f:

    # c "What [name] figured out."
    c "是[name]弄清楚的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3755
translate schinese m21rapwin_30464817:

    # g "*Sigh*, what [name] figured out."
    g "*叹气*，那是[name]查出来的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3756
translate schinese m21rapwin_aa2f228f:

    # g "He's only interested in humans, we tried figuring out why that is, we considered racism, but [name] had evidence otherwise."
    g "他只对人类感兴趣。我们试着探究原因，也考虑过种族歧视的可能，但[name]找到了反证。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3757
translate schinese m21rapwin_3ba68ad5:

    # a "[name] did?"
    a "[name]找到了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3759
translate schinese m21rapwin_64d10231:

    # c "You should've seen it! He was like a real detective!"
    c "你真该看看当时的情形！他简直就像个真正的侦探！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3760
translate schinese m21rapwin_5a02ed37:

    # g "Yeah, he cut through the investigation like a hot knife through butter."
    g "没错，他在调查过程中势如破竹，简直毫不费力。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3761
translate schinese m21rapwin_c708ae82:

    # a "Huh, cool."
    a "嗯，挺酷的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3762
translate schinese m21rapwin_53845902:

    # MC "Aw shucks, you're making me blush."
    MC "哎哟，你把我脸都说红了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3764
translate schinese m21rapwin_a31fb5ed:

    # c "He had some cool ideas too!"
    c "他也有一些很棒的点子！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3765
translate schinese m21rapwin_3478e316:

    # g "Yeah, he had some cool ideas while we were investigating, helped us figure it all out."
    g "是啊，我们在调查的时候他提出了一些很棒的点子，帮我们理清了头绪。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3766
translate schinese m21rapwin_c708ae82_1:

    # a "Huh, cool."
    a "嗯，挺酷的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3767
translate schinese m21rapwin_53845902_1:

    # MC "Aw shucks, you're making me blush."
    MC "哎哟，你把我脸都说红了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3769
translate schinese m21rapwin_ce14252b:

    # g "Mmhm."
    g "嗯。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3772
translate schinese m21rapwin_740dde80:

    # a "Hmm... I might be able to use this... well, not until we learn more."
    a "嗯……这东西或许能派上用场……不过，还得等我们了解更多情况再说。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3773
translate schinese m21rapwin_19744ebc:

    # MC "Got an idea?"
    MC "有什么主意吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3774
translate schinese m21rapwin_9124da8f:

    # a "Maybe..."
    a "也许吧……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3777
translate schinese m21rapwin_07fcbdb9:

    # a "You said I'm coming with you?"
    a "你是说我要跟你一起去？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3778
translate schinese m21rapwin_50112db5:

    # a "Then let's get moving, right? Sooner we get all this shit behind us, the sooner we can enjoy the party!"
    a "那我们就出发吧？早点把这些破事儿搞定，就能早点去享受派对了！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3779
translate schinese m21rapwin_5d10911e:

    # MC "You actually want to enjoy the party?"
    MC "你真的想去享受派对？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3780
translate schinese m21rapwin_20e0fec8:

    # a "Come on, [name], I may be bitter and spiteful but I'm not dead."
    a "得了吧，[name]，我虽然满腹牢骚、怨气冲天，但我还没死呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3781
translate schinese m21rapwin_6358e4ee:

    # a "I want to make the most out of my time here."
    a "我想充分利用在这儿的时光。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3788
translate schinese m21rapwin_6c03de78:

    # a "{i}You're{/i} more eager to trespass than I am."
    a "{i}你比我{/i}还热衷于擅闯禁地呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3789
translate schinese m21rapwin_23d875ca:

    # a "Got an agenda or are you just a fan of crime?"
    a "是有什么目的，还是单纯喜欢犯罪？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3793
translate schinese m21choice13_1_0fd91904:

    # MC "Oh, yeah. Going for vandalism next, gonna spray a dingle on every portrait I find."
    MC "噢，是啊。接下来打算搞点破坏，在见到的每幅肖像画上都喷个“丁丁”涂鸦。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3794
translate schinese m21choice13_1_b71c9d66:

    # a "That's the shit I'm talking about! Leave no piece of art un-dingled!"
    a "这才是我想说的！别放过任何一件艺术品，统统都得上“丁丁”标记！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3798
translate schinese m21choice13_2_ab69621f:

    # a "More than I do?"
    a "比我还了解？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3799
translate schinese m21choice13_2_1e20879b:

    # MC "Give me about... two more encounters with him, then yeah."
    MC "再跟他交手个……两次吧，到时候就差不多了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3800
translate schinese m21choice13_2_976eadb3:

    # a "Looks like you know him well."
    a "看来你很了解他啊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3806
translate schinese m21choice13_3_8b082d6b:

    # a "H-hey..."
    a "嘿……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3807
translate schinese m21choice13_3_14aa4d1c:

    # a "You don't need to risk getting arrested just for me."
    a "你没必要为了我冒被捕的风险。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3808
translate schinese m21choice13_3_7d056f28:

    # MC "Why not? You're my homie, my slime, my dawg."
    MC "为什么不呢？你可是我的好哥们儿、我的小史莱姆、我的老铁啊！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3809
translate schinese m21choice13_3_a6d23563:

    # MC "I can see how much you want this. It would be my pleasure to help you get it."
    MC "我看得出你有多想要这个。能帮你弄到手，是我的荣幸。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3812
translate schinese m21choice13_3_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3814
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_62741053:

    # a "I've got a question..."
    a "我有个问题……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3815
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_6674e0ce:

    # MC "Shoot."
    MC "问吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3816
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_c2d48104:

    # a "You wanted to check out the rooms without a keypad lock..."
    a "你想看看那些没有密码锁的房间……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3817
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_b503b90a:

    # MC "Sure did."
    MC "没错。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3820
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d9947999:

    # a "Then you're at the wrong fucking door."
    a "那你他妈找错门了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3821
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_68582e7b:

    # MC "I'm just checking out the locks. Might have an exploit, who knows?"
    MC "我只是在研究这些锁。说不定能找到什么漏洞，谁知道呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3822
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_c5b9bc03:

    # a "The best exploit would be finding the code."
    a "最好的“漏洞”莫过于直接弄到密码。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3823
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_4359dfe6:

    # MC "Sure, there are only ten-thousand combinations, wanna take turns?"
    MC "反正只有一万种组合，要轮流试试吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3824
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_e19db57a:

    # a "You first."
    a "你先来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3825
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_1b6ceaa6:

    # MC "What if they're alarmed?"
    MC "如果他们惊慌失措怎么办？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3826
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_6167c143:

    # a "You think they have it set up to alert the whole building when a new hire mistypes the passkey?"
    a "你觉得他们是不是把系统设置成了这样：一旦有新员工输错密码，整栋楼都会收到警报？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3827
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_1ab3d5e2:

    # MC "Might get logged in to a security system."
    MC "可能只是记录在安防系统里吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3828
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_3e27337e:

    # a "Just try something."
    a "试着输入点什么吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3829
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3836
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_936ae03e:

    # MC "Well, we know the passkey isn't zero-zero-zero-zero."
    MC "至少我们知道密码不是“0000”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3837
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_fa61b860:

    # a "Why don't you memorize that to save you time when you come back here in a fit of desperation?"
    a "你不如把这点记下来，省得下次走投无路跑回来时还要浪费时间。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3838
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3842
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2ebd262b:

    # MC "Who was that Elf in the photo with Hugo?"
    MC "照片里和雨果在一起的那个精灵是谁？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3843
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2266e913:

    # a "I forget his name."
    a "我忘了他的名字了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3844
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2baa9a7f:

    # a "He's Hugo's best friend, always has been."
    a "他是雨果最好的朋友，一直都是。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3845
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_ce81698e:

    # MC "Was he involved in the bullying?"
    MC "他参与了那起霸凌事件吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3846
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_f6b4d71c:

    # a "Yeah."
    a "对。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3847
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_91f1f1f8:

    # MC "His balls aren't on the table?"
    MC "难道不用拿他的“蛋蛋”开刀吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3848
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_dee2bcc7:

    # a "It's a ceremonial ball kick, [name]. I just want it done so I can move on."
    a "这只是一种象征性的“踢蛋”惩罚，[name]。我只想赶紧了结这事，好继续往前看。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3849
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_3f4ce018:

    # MC "You said you had an idea about the whole Hugo manwhoring thing?"
    MC "你之前说，关于雨果那种滥交的毛病，你有个主意？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3850
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_34fe1469:

    # a "Maybe, I have to think about it some more."
    a "也许吧，我得再考虑一下。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3851
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5967d3a0:

    # MC "Mind telling me?"
    MC "能告诉我吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3854
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_f61ad391:

    # a "N-no... Not until I know I'm going through with it."
    a "不、不……除非我确定自己真会去做，否则我不会说的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3855
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_83c7856a:

    # MC "???"
    MC "？？？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3858
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_67c8eb81:

    # MC "Whatever, dude. This door's useless, let's find one that isn't."
    MC "随你便吧，伙计。这扇门没用，我们找扇能用的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3859
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_77f4c500:

    # MC "Do you drink?"
    MC "你喝酒吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3860
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_0630154b:

    # a "I usually drink {i}after{/i} the job is done."
    a "我通常在任务完成后{i}才{/i}喝。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3861
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_ab341622:

    # MC "Half now, half later?"
    MC "现在喝一半，剩下的一半留到后面？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3862
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_8a2dfe44:

    # a "You're on."
    a "成交。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3869
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_9b4e319d:

    # g "How did it go with [name]?"
    g "你和[name]进展得怎么样？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3871
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d19f855d:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3872
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_bf76cb3b:

    # c "He's... nice..."
    c "他……人挺好的……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3873
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_14cd41df:

    # c "It's... less scary when it's just us two."
    c "只有我们两个人的话……就没那么可怕了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3874
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_1f564f3c:

    # g "I totally get that."
    g "我完全懂那种感觉。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3876
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_194bdef3:

    # c "It's just... well..."
    c "只是……嗯……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3877
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_08a79ca8:

    # g "What?"
    g "什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3880
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_65c4cda7:

    # c "I get the feeling he..."
    c "我总觉得他……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3881
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_777f681a:

    # c "I... {i}can't{/i} rely on him for everything..."
    c "我……{i}不能{/i}事事都依赖他……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3882
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_019539dc:

    # g "Hmm. Really? I think he's pretty dependable. At least where it counts."
    g "嗯？真的吗？我觉得他挺可靠的。至少在关键时刻是这样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3883
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_beb62a41:

    # c "[size20small]Then maybe {i}I{/i} don't count..."
    c "[size20small]那也许{i}我{/i}并不算在“关键”之列吧……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3884
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_295a84e1:

    # g "What was that?"
    g "你说什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3885
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_f08067fe:

    # c "Nothing."
    c "没什么。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3886
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_c89393e3:

    # c "Let's move on. I know I have."
    c "换个话题吧。我知道我已经放下了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3888
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_6632fbc8:

    # g "You're talking weird."
    g "你说话怪怪的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3889
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_3761be4f:

    # c "Sorry. I do that sometimes."
    c "抱歉。我有时候就是这样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3893
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_a4e625d7:

    # c "!!!"
    c "！！！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3896
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_1efa678f:

    # g "What?! What's with that reaction?"
    g "什么？！你那是什么反应？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3897
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_ce5e6acc:

    # c "N-nothing!"
    c "没、没什么！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3898
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2c835f6f:

    # g "It's not nothing, and you're a terrible liar!"
    g "才不是没什么，而且你撒谎的水平太烂了！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3899
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_dfd8e0b0:

    # g "Did something embarrassing happen to you?"
    g "是不是发生了什么丢脸的事？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3907
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_c2f3658b:

    # g "Aren't you gonna tell me about it?"
    g "你不打算告诉我吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3915
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_597ac385:

    # g "Boo. Tell me."
    g "切。告诉我嘛。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3922
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_cb469a07:

    # g "Fine, I'll just ask [name]"
    g "好吧，那我就去问[name]。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3923
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_944c2b0f:

    # c "H-he won't tell you either!"
    c "他、他也不会告诉你的！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3924
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5a7443bd:

    # g "It's {i}that{/i} embarrassing? What the fuck happened?"
    g "有{i}那么{/i}丢脸吗？到底发生了什么事？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3927
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_ddb76f7d:

    # g "Okay, okay, I'll drop it."
    g "行行行，我不问了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3928
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_81e0d5b3:

    # g "Tell me about the not-embarrassing parts."
    g "跟我说说那些不丢人的部分吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3931
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_a00563e2:

    # c "It was nice... we stayed away from everyone... mostly."
    c "挺好的……我们避开了所有人……大部分时间是这样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3932
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d6c55cd2:

    # g "How did the camera come into it?"
    g "那相机是怎么回事？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3933
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d49c263f:

    # c "Umm... I'm not lying... we found a tiger..."
    c "呃……我没撒谎……我们发现了一只老虎……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3934
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_0daf48de:

    # g "A fucking tiger?"
    g "一只他妈的老虎？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3935
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5eae321d:

    # c "Yup."
    c "是啊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3936
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_a9cb76a3:

    # g "Rich kids..."
    g "富家子弟啊……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3937
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_259cf697:

    # c "Animal handler was a tech-illiterate drunk. Thought he took pictures of himself drunk on the job. Gave us the camera to dispose of the evidence."
    c "那个驯兽员是个不懂技术的酒鬼。他以为自己拍下了上班时喝醉的照片，就把相机交给我们，让我们销毁证据。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3938
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_8b8282c4:

    # g "That's a lot of coincidences."
    g "这巧合也太多了吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3939
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_86d01ab6:

    # g "Hmm..."
    g "嗯……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3942
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_775ff4d6:

    # g "So what do you wanna do?"
    g "那你打算怎么办？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3943
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_cd2dc04b:

    # c "...I dunno... this place isn't for me..."
    c "……我不知道……这里不太适合我……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3944
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_cd6142ee:

    # c "You shouldn't have brought me here... Mom... Noelle... they would've liked it more..."
    c "你不该带我来这儿的……妈妈……诺艾尔……她们会更喜欢这里的……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3945
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3946
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5570c253:

    # g "Chloe."
    g "克洛伊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3947
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_f6459400:

    # g "I don't tell you this very often..."
    g "我很少对你说这种话……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3951
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_f4ff6d8f:

    # c "Wha-"
    c "什——"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3955
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_8dfc7163:

    # g "I'm about to embarrass both of us so savor it."
    g "接下来我要说的话可能会让我们俩都觉得尴尬，所以好好听着吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3956
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d19f855d_1:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3957
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_81c365ff:

    # g "Chloe. I love you."
    g "克洛伊，我爱你。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3958
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d19f855d_2:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3961
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_3dad7590:

    # c "Huh?! Why?!"
    c "哈？！为什么？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3962
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_380a9fde:

    # c "I'm shit!"
    c "我真是个糟糕透顶的人！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3963
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2ec421c5:

    # c "I have no social skills, I don't leave the house, I don't even talk to {i}you{/i}!"
    c "我没有社交能力，从不出门，甚至连跟你说话都不敢！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3966
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_e5407962:

    # g "D-do I need a reason to love my shitty little sister?"
    g "需、需要什么理由，我才会爱我那个糟糕透顶的妹妹吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3967
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_b2d1f2b0:

    # g "I brought you here {i}because{/i} I love you, okay."
    g "我带你来这儿，{i}就是{/i}因为我爱你，明白吗。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3968
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_1f405a1c:

    # g "I want you to have experiences and things to remember. I want you to dress nice, I want to spend time with you."
    g "我希望你能有各种经历，留下美好的回忆。我希望你打扮得漂漂亮亮的，也想多花点时间陪陪你。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3969
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_b010c2f3:

    # g "And I've seen how much happier you seem around people you trust, like Neeta and [name]."
    g "我发现，和像妮塔及[name]这样你信任的人在一起时，你看起来快乐多了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3970
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_192192ca:

    # g "You're not anti-social. You just need the right people."
    g "你并不孤僻，只是需要遇到对的人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3971
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_71bf1b54:

    # g "So just give up and love me back, okay? And have some fun while you're at it."
    g "所以，干脆放弃抵抗，也来爱我吧，好吗？顺便还能享受一下其中的乐趣。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3972
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d19f855d_3:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3973
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_6c98153b:

    # c "This is like being cuddled by a statue."
    c "这感觉就像被一尊雕像抱着一样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3976
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_fca5e453:

    # g "Oh, shut up. I'm springy where it counts."
    g "噢，闭嘴吧。我在关键部位可是很有弹性的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3977
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5fed7042:

    # g "Great way to respond to someone who poured their heart out to you."
    g "这就是你回应那个向你敞开心扉的人的方式吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3978
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_942f76a3:

    # c "Mmm... Don't make me say it..."
    c "唔……别逼我说出来……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3979
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2a07e028:

    # g "If you had any concept of fairness, you wouldn't leave me hanging like this."
    g "如果你还有点公平观念，就不会让我这样悬着心干等了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3982
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_9499934f:

    # c "I..."
    c "我……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3983
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_68c82561:

    # c "*Grumble*"
    c "*嘟囔*"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3984
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_188b4104:

    # g "You know, this looks like a cuddle, but this is actually my iron grip holding you in place."
    g "你知道吗？这看起来像是在拥抱，但其实我正用铁一般的力量把你牢牢锁住呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3985
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_a4b93459:

    # g "I'll only release you if you say the passphrase."
    g "除非你说出那句暗号，否则我绝不放开你。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3986
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d19f855d_4:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3987
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_ff12c376:

    # c "I love you too..."
    c "我也爱你……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3993
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_355ef840:

    # g "Oh, now I'm fired up!" with vpunch
    g "噢，我现在浑身干劲十足！" with vpunch

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3994
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_eee4dbee:

    # g "Let's go, you're having the time of your life tonight or so help me!"
    g "走吧，今晚我一定要让你玩个痛快，否则我绝不罢休！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3995
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d57c9b06:

    # c "Wahh! Put me down!"
    c "哇！放我下来！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3996
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_366777c5:

    # g "You like video games, don't you?"
    g "你喜欢电子游戏，对吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:3997
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5a023d54:

    # c "Where are we going?"
    c "我们要去哪？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4017
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_523cfec0:

    # MC "So, are you gonna tell me how a humble university student got us into a high-society ball?"
    MC "那么，你打算告诉我，一个普普通通的大学生是怎么带我们混进上流社会舞会的吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4018
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5d67c338:

    # MC "Seems like quite a challenge while you're trying to make ends meet."
    MC "对于一个还要为生计发愁的人来说，这听起来可真不是件容易的事。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4019
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_9af9b33b:

    # MC "Oh, right, maybe your previous association with these aristocrats has something to do with it."
    MC "噢，对了，也许你之前和这些贵族打交道的事儿跟这也有点关系。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4020
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4023
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_8d56b6ae:

    # a "I'll show you mine if you show me yours."
    a "你给我看你的，我就给你看我的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4026
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_69b11168:

    # MC "Heh. That's more like it."
    MC "呵。这还像点样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4030
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_784181fc:

    # a "We each take turns. Refuse to answer; it goes down the hatch."
    a "我们轮流来。如果拒绝回答，就得把酒喝下去。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4031
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2543de57:

    # MC "Deal."
    MC "成交。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4032
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_65654b98:

    # a "Who goes first?"
    a "谁先来？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4033
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5d07ff6f:

    # MC "You. If you wanted me to go first you should've said that instead of asking."
    MC "你啊。如果你想让我先来，直接说就行了，何必还要问呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4034
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_5b3947c0:

    # a "Shouldn't we go somewhere {i}away{/i} from prying ears?"
    a "我们是不是该离那些爱偷听的耳朵{i}远一点{/i}？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4035
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_436c0a4d:

    # MC "Sure, let's just grab one more each, who knows how many secrets we're holding on to?"
    MC "行啊，那咱们每人再来一个问题吧——谁知道我们心里还藏着多少秘密呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4041
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_ba2029ac:

    # MC "Sorry about that, buddy. I'm sure you're a nice guy, but you know how it is."
    MC "抱歉了，伙计。我相信你是个好人，但你也懂的，情况就是这么回事。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4046
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_f3f33033:

    # a "Wanna add a question limit?"
    a "要不要加个提问次数的限制？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4047
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_a3a85e3e:

    # MC "If anything we need a time limit, don't forget we're on a mission."
    MC "与其那样，不如限制时间；别忘了我们还有任务在身呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4048
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_8c4c4123:

    # MC "Let's not waste time here. Game ends when someone is out of drinks."
    MC "别在这儿浪费时间了。有人酒喝光了，游戏就结束。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4049
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_c7b7562a:

    # a "Punishment?"
    a "惩罚是什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4050
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_47bd3bd2:

    # MC "Gotta finish the other guy's alcohol."
    MC "得把对方剩下的酒喝光。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4051
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_7162c239:

    # a "Deal."
    a "成交。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4054
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_175cbe02:

    # MC "Question one:"
    MC "第一个问题："

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4055
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_18566bb1:

    # MC "{b}Did you buy our way into this party?{/b}"
    MC "{b}你是花钱让我们混进这场派对的吗？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4058
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4059
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_9a58adc6:

    # a "No."
    a "不。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4060
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2ba50235:

    # a "{b}How did you get tied up with Dr. Bashford?{/b}"
    a "{b}你是怎么跟巴什福德博士扯上关系的？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4062
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_983c6268:

    # MC "I saved him from a thief. Used magic to stop a thrown knife from lodging itself in his frontal lobe."
    MC "我从一个小偷手里救了他。用魔法挡下了一把飞刀，没让它扎进自己的额叶。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4063
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_ca9bf335:

    # MC "Saw I was quite good at magic, so he offered me a place at the university."
    MC "他见我在魔法方面颇有天赋，便邀请我进入那所大学深造。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4064
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_1138df0c:

    # MC "Then explain, {b}how did you get us in here?{/b}"
    MC "那你解释一下，{b}你是怎么带我们进来的？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4066
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_bb8e4b4e_2:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4067
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d53be99e:

    # a "Cashed in an old favor with a friend."
    a "找一位老朋友兑现了以前的人情。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4068
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_18aef529:

    # MC "Someone we know?"
    MC "是我们认识的人吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4069
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_b76a2005:

    # a "That's two questions in a row."
    a "这已经是连着问了两个问题了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4070
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_a10d89da:

    # a "{b}What's your affinity?{/b}"
    a "{b}你的魔法亲和力是什么？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4072
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2d204a49_2:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4075
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_877adf35:

    # a "Ha!"
    a "哈！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4076
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_93b3376c:

    # a "Now why would you hide something like that?"
    a "你为什么要隐瞒那种事呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4079
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_89d1ffc2:

    # MC "Ugh, this shit isn't made to be downed."
    MC "啧，这玩意儿根本就不是拿来一口气灌下去的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4080
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_eb9bd9f9:

    # MC "Any idea what concentration it is?"
    MC "知道浓度是多少吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4081
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_f794d632:

    # a "Is that your question?"
    a "这就是你的问题吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4084
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2d204a49_3:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4085
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d747aec0:

    # MC "{b}What kind of family do you come from?{/b}"
    MC "{b}你来自什么样的家庭？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4088
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_bb8e4b4e_3:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4089
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_65abf876:

    # a "The type of family you'd find in a place like this. Not that I want it that way."
    a "那种会在这种地方见到的家庭。并不是说我希望那样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4090
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_bb8e4b4e_4:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4091
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_e36f1bbf:

    # a "{b}Would you say you're normal?{/b}"
    a "{b}你会说自己是个正常人吗？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4093
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_2d204a49_4:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4094
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_8f7dc949:

    # MC "Not anymore."
    MC "现在不了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4095
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_83f8301c:

    # MC "{b}Would you say that {i}you're{/i} normal?{/b}"
    MC "{b}你会说{i}自己{/i}是个正常人吗？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4104
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_76bade3a:

    # a "I am now."
    a "我现在是了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4105
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_eef1ffc3:

    # MC "What's that supposed to mean?"
    MC "你这话是什么意思？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4106
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_1a167dc2:

    # a "What's \"not anymore\" supposed to mean?"
    a "“以前不是了”这话是什么意思？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4107
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_d3dcfb70:

    # MC "Touché."
    MC "说得好。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4108
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_4d37d608:

    # a "{b}Would you say you're living a new life?{/b}"
    a "{b}你会说自己正在过一种新的生活吗？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4114
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_530f9d2d:

    # MC "Yeah. Yeah I would."
    MC "嗯。是的，我会这么说。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4115
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_7b5f938b:

    # a "Hmm. Everyone has secrets. I'm starting to feel like your secrets are on par with mine."
    a "嗯……每个人都有秘密。我开始觉得，你的秘密跟我的一样分量不轻。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4116
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_cba384fb:

    # MC "Thanks for that, Ashley, you've just saved me a question."
    MC "谢谢你，阿什莉，你省了我一个问题。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4117
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_803550de:

    # MC "So. We're both living new lives..."
    MC "所以……我们都在过着新的生活……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4118
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_fb5f64ee:

    # a "I never said that."
    a "我可没这么说。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4119
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_44eeaffc:

    # MC "No. You didn't."
    MC "没有。没沾到。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4122
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_3d20e5f9:

    # MC "{b}Is \"Ashley\" your real name?{/b}"
    MC "{b}“阿什莉”是你的真名吗？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4131
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_551110cc:

    # MC "You know you just answered my question, right?"
    MC "你知道你刚才已经回答了我的问题，对吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4132
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_a34a4c30:

    # a "Consider that as me preemptively drinking for the inevitable follow-up question."
    a "就把这当成是我为了应对接下来肯定会问的问题，而提前喝的一杯吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4133
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_a665c7f4:

    # a "{b}Why did Chloe ask me about Clement?{/b}"
    a "{b}克洛伊为什么要问我关于克莱门特的事？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4136
translate schinese m21afterchoice13_abe24253:

    # MC "!!!"
    MC "！！！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4140
translate schinese m21choice14_1_7cc8f65f:

    # MC "He's a magical anomaly."
    MC "他是个魔法异常体。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4141
translate schinese m21choice14_1_8209d99a:

    # MC "Just his presence makes me sick. Like he's radioactive."
    MC "光是他在那儿，就让我觉得恶心。就像他带有放射性一样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4142
translate schinese m21choice14_1_bf17a7ed:

    # MC "I'm struggling to take my mind off of him, so thanks for the reminder."
    MC "我正努力不去想他呢，所以谢谢你的提醒。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4145
translate schinese m21choice14_1_ab96bad8:

    # a "You know. No one else has mentioned anything. No one else is avoiding him."
    a "得了吧，没别人提过这事。也没人在躲着他。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4146
translate schinese m21choice14_1_ccdbdb0e:

    # a "{i}I{/i} certainly don't notice anything like that."
    a "{i}我{/i}可没察觉到那种事。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4147
translate schinese m21choice14_1_c62f2858:

    # a "So either you're lying."
    a "所以，要么你在撒谎。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4148
translate schinese m21choice14_1_709b5338:

    # a "Or {b}your interpretation of magic isn't the same as everyone else's.{/b}"
    a "{b}要么就是你对魔法的理解和别人不一样。{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4149
translate schinese m21choice14_1_8ce4d87c:

    # a "I wasn't asking you about Dr. Bashford on a whim."
    a "我问起巴什福德博士可不是心血来潮。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4150
translate schinese m21choice14_1_a11de9ed:

    # a "You're a special case, and you're hiding it."
    a "你是个特例，而且你在隐瞒这一点。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4153
translate schinese m21choice14_1_45599f1b:

    # MC "{b}Why haven't we met your girlfriend yet?{/b}"
    MC "{b}为什么我们还没见过你的女朋友？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4156
translate schinese m21choice14_1_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4157
translate schinese m21choice14_1_2ff06b38:

    # a "She's real if that's what you're asking."
    a "如果你是想问这个的话——她是真实存在的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4158
translate schinese m21choice14_1_40f07d6b:

    # MC "It's not."
    MC "我问的不是这个。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4159
translate schinese m21choice14_1_f7098343:

    # a "...I don't like mixing social circles."
    a "……我不喜欢把不同的社交圈混在一起。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4160
translate schinese m21choice14_1_90752de6:

    # a "I want to keep them as far away from each other as possible. It's never worked for me in the past."
    a "我想让它们尽可能保持距离。过去这招对我从没奏效过。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4161
translate schinese m21choice14_1_6dbe0214:

    # a "That's if you want to believe I have many social circles left."
    a "那得看你愿不愿意相信我还剩下很多社交圈子。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4162
translate schinese m21choice14_1_99906bc5:

    # a "{b}Are you a valuable person to the world of magic?{/b}"
    a "{b}对魔法界而言，你是个有价值的人吗？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4165
translate schinese m21choice14_1_c29ff9a1:

    # MC "Waste of a question."
    MC "这个问题问了也白问。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4166
translate schinese m21choice14_1_9950490e:

    # a "And why is that?"
    a "为什么这么说？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4167
translate schinese m21choice14_1_06feee37:

    # MC "Because I don't know the answer. I don't know anything about magic, and I don't know anything about myself."
    MC "因为我不知道答案。我对魔法一无所知，对自己也一无所知。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4168
translate schinese m21choice14_1_7740d173:

    # a "Don't know anything about magic, yet at a magical university. Fascinating."
    a "对魔法一无所知，却身处魔法大学。真有意思。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4169
translate schinese m21choice14_1_74dfbf47:

    # MC "{b}Are things going well with you and your girlfriend?{/b}"
    MC "{b}你和你女朋友进展如何？{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4172
translate schinese m21choice14_1_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4173
translate schinese m21choice14_1_bd6d0f2c:

    # a "Congratulations."
    a "恭喜。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4179
translate schinese m21choice14_1_48f6fa75:

    # a "You win."
    a "你赢了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4180
translate schinese m21choice14_1_fa8bd49b:

    # a "Even when I had you backed up against the wall."
    a "就算我把你逼到墙角也一样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4181
translate schinese m21choice14_1_284ac99a:

    # a "Give me the other drink, we need to get out of here."
    a "把另一杯酒给我，我们得离开这儿了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4182
translate schinese m21choice14_1_dbae8131:

    # MC "Better luck next time."
    MC "下次运气好点吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4183
translate schinese m21choice14_1_bba26fe8:

    # a "I learned enough."
    a "我已经了解得够多了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4189
translate schinese m21choice14_2_7cc38f44:

    # a "Ha! I win!"
    a "哈！我赢了！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4190
translate schinese m21choice14_2_b5989bb9:

    # a "Thought I wish I could've learned a little more."
    a "真想能多了解一点就好了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4193
translate schinese m21choice14_2_9754a36c:

    # MC "Give me the other drink, we need to get out of here."
    MC "把另一杯酒给我，我们得离开这儿了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4194
translate schinese m21choice14_2_dbae8131:

    # MC "Better luck next time."
    MC "下次运气好点吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4195
translate schinese m21choice14_2_bba26fe8:

    # a "I learned enough."
    a "我已经了解得够多了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4196
translate schinese m21choice14_2_7db6419d:

    # MC "Yeah, me too."
    MC "是啊，我也是。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4202
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_275b31f9:

    # a "Apparently, there's a woman on the premises."
    a "听说这附近有个女人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4203
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_1755d368:

    # MC "Yeah, I can see that."
    MC "嗯，我看到了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4204
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_8d00c51f:

    # a "One that {i}shouldn't{/i} be here. When I was making myself over I overheard some security officials."
    a "一个{i}不该{/i}出现在这儿的人。我刚才在做伪装的时候，无意间听到了几个安保人员的谈话。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4205
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_e04348ef:

    # a "They've spotted a woman outside behaving strangely."
    a "他们发现外面有个女人行迹可疑。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4206
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_1488eee7:

    # MC "Strange how?"
    MC "怎么个可疑法？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4207
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_45b964c8:

    # a "Uhh, like trespassing. I believe the words I heard were, \"It's like something out of a spy movie\"."
    a "呃，就像是擅闯禁地之类的。我记得他们当时说：“简直像间谍电影里的情节一样”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4208
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_a0e95e21:

    # a "They catch glimpses of her, but she uses cover well. Gone until they spot her somewhere else."
    a "他们偶尔能瞥见她的身影，但她很擅长利用掩体躲藏。一旦消失，就得等到在别处再次发现她了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4209
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_1f178c92:

    # MC "Think she's a thief?"
    MC "你觉得她是小偷吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4210
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_2049968c:

    # a "Chose a hell of a day to try it."
    a "她挑的日子可真够呛。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4213
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_71f72ca7:

    # MC "Hey."
    MC "嘿。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4216
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_72e5c601:

    # MC "No keypad."
    MC "没有密码锁。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4217
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_0959b9e4:

    # a "And one guard."
    a "而且只有一个守卫。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4218
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_f003f518:

    # MC "Very observant."
    MC "观察得很仔细嘛。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4219
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_37a39b43:

    # MC "No mask."
    MC "没戴面具。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4220
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_08dd39ec:

    # a "I guess that's a security privilege."
    a "我想那是安保人员的特权吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4221
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_0a4159c4:

    # a "So we've traded a lock for a guard. This room is no more accessible than the others."
    a "所以我们是用守卫换掉了门锁。这间屋子和其他房间一样，都不好进去。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4222
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_321836fd:

    # MC "Might be important if there's a guard."
    MC "如果有守卫的话，这可能很重要。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4223
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_3f93c9f1:

    # a "And how exactly do you plan on learning what's behind that door?"
    a "那你打算怎么弄清楚门后到底有什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4224
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_e2605391:

    # MC "Easy, we ask him."
    MC "简单，直接问他就行。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4225
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_e50bf654:

    # a "What?!"
    a "什么？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4226
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_088d5f63:

    # MC "Calm down, the worst we're gonna get is a \"none of your business\"."
    MC "别急，最坏的结果也就是挨一句“不关你的事”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4229
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_963097b5:

    # MC "Hey, big guy, what's behind the door?"
    MC "嘿，大块头，门后是什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4230
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_4cda2dc9:

    # sec "It's restricted."
    sec "那是禁区。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4231
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_5a08631f:

    # MC "Why?"
    MC "为什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4232
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_b7cd8550:

    # sec "Because we can't have guests running around the infirmary. Sensitive equipment, needs to be clear in the case of an emergency. You get the idea."
    sec "因为不能让访客在医务室里乱逛。里面有精密设备，而且紧急情况下通道必须保持畅通。你懂的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4233
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_f63b740b:

    # MC "Aww, that's a shame. I was hoping that's where you kept the vault."
    MC "噢，真可惜。我还以为金库就藏在里面呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4234
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_37ad7fe0:

    # sec "Heh. Better luck next time."
    sec "呵。下次好运吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4235
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_3e349edb:

    # MC "Aight, man. Have a good night. I'll be back when I break my leg."
    MC "行吧，伙计。祝你晚安。等我哪天摔断了腿再回来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4238
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_1c19aecb:

    # MC "Infirmary."
    MC "医务室。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4239
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_3f55c882:

    # a "Still wanna go in?"
    a "还想进去吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4240
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_f2053e2e:

    # MC "Duh."
    MC "废话。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4241
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_452e38fe:

    # a "The fuck are you looking for in there? Opiates?"
    a "你到底想在里面找什么？阿片类药物？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4242
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_762ace27:

    # MC "Do you think they have them? Vicodin looks so yummy."
    MC "你觉得他们会有吗？维柯丁（Vicodin）看起来真诱人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4243
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_8c136f9c:

    # a "How are we getting in there? Plan on starting a medical emergency?"
    a "我们要怎么进去？打算制造个医疗急救事件吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4244
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_9d02e37b:

    # MC "His magic is weak."
    MC "他的魔法很弱。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4245
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_50d7c1ad:

    # a "What does that have to do with anything?"
    a "这有什么关系？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4246
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_6567939e:

    # MC "Watch this. Follow me."
    MC "看好了。跟我来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4249
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_9ed1efe2:

    # MC "Hey, dude. I broke my leg."
    MC "嘿，伙计。我把腿弄断了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4274
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_7b04e3b6:

    # a "W-what the fuck did you just do?!"
    a "你、你他妈刚才干了什么？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4277
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_456f1ee8:

    # MC "Stay on the lookout and let me know if anyone's gonna interrupt my search."
    MC "帮我盯着点，如果有人要打扰我搜寻，记得告诉我。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4278
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_491c780a:

    # MC "He'll become aware in like, ten seconds."
    MC "大概十秒钟后他就会察觉到了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4285
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_43422c9c:

    # a "Wh..."
    a "什……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4286
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_c01c8807:

    # a "The fuck, dude?"
    a "搞什么鬼啊，伙计？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4289
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_89265fb3:

    # sec "Hey."
    sec "嘿。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4290
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_5ed72b0e:

    # sec "What was that all about? Where's your friend?"
    sec "刚才那是怎么回事？你朋友呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4291
translate schinese m21afterchoice14_e2d31e27:

    # a "Uhh... leg's healed..."
    a "呃……腿伤好了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4320
translate schinese main22_88130a13:

    # g "Suck on this!"
    g "尝尝这个！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4341
translate schinese main22_9591750c:

    # c "...You missed..."
    c "……你打偏了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4342
translate schinese main22_249136f2:

    # g "Yeah, I can tell, thanks for reiterating how much I suck though."
    g "是啊，我看得出来；不过还是谢谢你特意强调我有多菜。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4343
translate schinese main22_507f9527:

    # g "I should've spent hours training on those shooting games like you do."
    g "我真该像你那样，花上几个小时练练那些射击游戏的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4344
translate schinese main22_efda582e:

    # c "I'm not training... they're fun..."
    c "我可不是在训练……这很有趣……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4345
translate schinese main22_5bbfe9b4:

    # c "Though there's usually more... running, and jumping."
    c "虽然通常会有更多的……奔跑和跳跃动作。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4346
translate schinese main22_2d310007:

    # g "See! I'm good at that! Why am I lying still for this? Where's the obstacle course when you need it?"
    g "瞧！我可是很擅长那些的！为什么我现在非得躺着不动呢？关键时刻障碍赛道跑哪儿去了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4347
translate schinese main22_c9701498:

    # c "If you can't hit a target while lying still, you're never hitting it while running around."
    c "如果连静止不动都打不中目标，那你跑起来的时候就更别想打中了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4348
translate schinese main22_45b50023:

    # g "Shush, I'm concentrating, I wanna get at least one hit off."
    g "嘘，我正在集中精神呢，我至少想击中一次。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4349
translate schinese main22_1162e855:

    # c "Aim higher."
    c "瞄准高一点。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4350
translate schinese main22_08a79ca8:

    # g "What?"
    g "什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4351
translate schinese main22_c028dc77:

    # c "Gravity."
    c "重力因素。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4352
translate schinese main22_b522160f:

    # g "Huh, really? I thought bullets were faster than that."
    g "咦，真的吗？我以为子弹的速度比那还要快呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4353
translate schinese main22_77df5681:

    # g "Are you some kind of secret gun nut or something?"
    g "难道你是个隐藏的枪械发烧友之类的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4354
translate schinese main22_de8c8b5a:

    # c "N-no... well uh... they're cool and stuff but... it's just the games really..."
    c "不、不……那个……枪确实挺酷的，不过……真的只是因为游戏……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4355
translate schinese main22_06479c04:

    # c "You... You look cool right now."
    c "你……你现在的样子看起来很帅。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4356
translate schinese main22_68733955:

    # g "Huh, you think so?"
    g "咦，真的吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4357
translate schinese main22_b693450a:

    # c "Y-yeah... I think the rifle suits you... uh, in a way..."
    c "嗯……我觉得那把步枪很适合你……呃，某种意义上来说……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4358
translate schinese main22_5c838fab:

    # g "Do you still have that camera?"
    g "你还带着那台相机吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4359
translate schinese main22_c8bd9011:

    # c "It's conveniently placed off-screen."
    c "它正好放在画面之外。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4360
translate schinese main22_9e2d5bfd:

    # g "Can I get a picture? Pretty please?"
    g "能帮我拍张照吗？拜托了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4361
translate schinese main22_ca2085b6:

    # c "A normal please is fine..."
    c "其实只要正常说声拜托就行了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4365
translate schinese main22_dfc92884:

    # c "Woah..."
    c "哇……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4366
translate schinese main22_d583b9e7:

    # g "What is it, what is it?"
    g "怎么了，怎么了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4367
translate schinese main22_bd9a4acb:

    # c "It's just... a really cool photo."
    c "只是……拍出了一张超帅的照片。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4368
translate schinese main22_27b33d56:

    # g "Well, yeah, that's 'cause {i}I'm{/i} in it."
    g "嗯，是啊，那是因为{i}我{/i}在里面嘛。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4369
translate schinese main22_d64a9255:

    # g "I can't do cute and pretty so I'll settle for cool."
    g "我走不了可爱漂亮的路线，所以只能退而求其次，走酷酷的风格了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4370
translate schinese main22_03d4b5e7:

    # c "Mm... just like me..."
    c "嗯……就像我一样……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4371
translate schinese main22_f5f69879:

    # g "You're cool? Since when?"
    g "你很酷？从什么时候开始的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4372
translate schinese main22_6b1b8df1:

    # c "Shut up... I meant I can't do cute and pretty..."
    c "闭嘴……我是说我走不了可爱漂亮的路线……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4373
translate schinese main22_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4376
translate schinese main22_4b340443_1:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4379
translate schinese main22_efbf3502:

    # c "Wh- Grace?"
    c "什——格蕾丝？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4382
translate schinese main22_f44f5275:

    # g "Do you think she's cute and pretty?"
    g "你觉得她可爱漂亮吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4383
translate schinese main22_aaf1e0dc:

    # nobody "I'm blind."
    nobody "我是个瞎子。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4396
translate schinese main22_4c1c469b:

    # g "You're way cuter, prettier, and girlier than I'll ever be."
    g "你比我可爱、漂亮、有女人味多了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4397
translate schinese main22_51d160c7:

    # c "No way! It's the other way around! You know how to do makeup and dye your hair and stuff."
    c "哪有！明明是你才对！你会化妆、染发之类的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4398
translate schinese main22_3629af10:

    # c "I just do whatever people tell me."
    c "我只是照着别人的话去做而已。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4399
translate schinese main22_4d0bd293:

    # g "Yeah, and you pull it off with no effort. Face it, you're a girl who's built like a girl."
    g "是啊，而且你做得毫不费力。面对现实吧，你就是那种天生有着女孩子身形的女生。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4400
translate schinese main22_26a5ee9a:

    # g "You're all small and delicate-looking. Everything I'm not."
    g "你看起来娇小又纤细。这些特质我全都没有。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4401
translate schinese main22_b08ca461:

    # g "I'm even letting my hair grow out a little and I still just look like a boy."
    g "我甚至试着把头发留长了一点，可看起来还是像个男孩子。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4402
translate schinese main22_da831141:

    # c "Wh-what about your... [size20small]your boobs?"
    c "那……那你的……[size20small]你的胸部呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4403
translate schinese main22_85568bab:

    # g "They're not even that big. And besides, what's strapped to your chest isn't everything. Sometimes I wanna do girly things, you know?"
    g "其实也没多大。再说，胸前长什么样并不代表一切。有时候我也想做些女孩子气的事，你懂吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4406
translate schinese main22_4a4e576a:

    # g "Sometimes, I just wish I looked like you."
    g "有时候，我真希望自己能长得像你一样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4414
translate schinese main22_d702c7bc:

    # g "*Tsk*"
    g "*啧*"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4417
translate schinese main22_f4cbc7fb:

    # nobody "Ha! Missed again!"
    nobody "哈！又没打中！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4422
translate schinese main22_6dd73d24:

    # nobody "You're not even going to touch the leaderboard like that. What are you even doing here?"
    nobody "照你这样玩，连排行榜的边都摸不到。你到底来这儿干嘛的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4423
translate schinese main22_c713010c:

    # g "Excuse me?! I'm trying to have fun over here, there's no need to be so rude."
    g "请问？！我正玩得开心呢，没必要这么粗鲁吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4424
translate schinese main22_5a5dfbd8:

    # nobody "Fun?! You think this is a game?"
    nobody "玩？！你以为这是在玩游戏吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4425
translate schinese main22_1f00cc05:

    # g "Uhh, isn't that {i}literally{/i} what this is?"
    g "呃，这不{i}确实{/i}就是个游戏吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4426
translate schinese main22_3eebc333:

    # nobody "Good grief, you're an uncultured dullard, aren't you?"
    nobody "天哪，你真是个没教养的蠢货，对吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4427
translate schinese main22_b90b0f8d:

    # g "What?!"
    g "什么？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4428
translate schinese main22_a315ddc5:

    # sh "As I said, only a cave-dwelling imbecile wouldn't recognize I, Samuel Harper, the most {i}decorated{/i} collector in the country."
    sh "我说过，只有住在山洞里的白痴才认不出我——塞缪尔·哈珀，全国{i}荣誉最显赫{/i}的收藏家。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4429
translate schinese main22_92498d0a:

    # g "And only a pompous, performative prick would refer to themselves as \"I\" when they're the object of the sentence."
    g "只有那种自命不凡、爱作秀的混蛋，才会明明处于句子的宾语位置，却偏要用“我”（主格形式）来称呼自己。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4430
translate schinese main22_e81c0a3d:

    # g "What's your problem? Just let me shoot in peace."
    g "你到底有什么毛病？让我安安静静地射击不行吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4431
translate schinese main22_57b64ed0:

    # sh "Oh no, you're not lulling me into any sense of security, not with your abysmal aim."
    sh "噢不，别想让我放松警惕——就凭你那烂得要命的准头，根本不可能。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4432
translate schinese main22_2e7f4a59:

    # sh "{b}That necklace is mine!{/b}"
    sh "{b}那条项链是我的！{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4435
translate schinese main22_a85677e4:

    # sh "Such exquisite craftsmanship, the likes that shouldn't grace the skin of a brutish, discourteous woman such as yourself."
    sh "如此精湛的工艺，实在不配出现在像你这样粗鲁无礼的女人身上。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4436
translate schinese main22_56a900d6:

    # g "\"Brutish\"?! Oh, now you're just asking for it. I don't care how \"decorated\" you are, but I'm gonna decorate your tongue with my balls before this is over."
    g "“粗鲁”？！噢，你这是自找苦吃。我才不管你身上挂了多少“勋章”，但在这一切结束之前，我非得把我的蛋蛋塞进你嘴里，给你那舌头好好“装饰”一番不可。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4437
translate schinese main22_dce1fbfd:

    # sh "Hmph, I wouldn't be surprised if you really {i}do{/i} have such equipment down there."
    sh "哼，如果你裤裆底下真有那种家伙事儿，我一点也不会觉得奇怪。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4440
translate schinese main22_fba3f21d:

    # g "I wasn't even in it for the competition, but if the top prize is wiping that shit-eating expression off of your face..."
    g "我本来根本不在乎什么比赛，但如果头奖是能让你那副令人作呕的嘴脸消失……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4441
translate schinese main22_4b340443_2:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4442
translate schinese main22_24a7b47f:

    # gt "Damn it... this fucking thing is all swaying about and shit."
    gt "该死……这破玩意儿晃来晃去的，真他妈烦人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4443
translate schinese main22_a5e286bd:

    # gt "I need to start paying more respect to sharpshooters... wind... gravity... and the rifle is fighting against me..."
    gt "我得对神射手们多点敬意了……风向……重力……还有这把跟我作对的步枪……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4444
translate schinese main22_ed541ea4:

    # gt "\"Samuel Harper\"? Never heard of you, dumbass. Who the fuck knows decorated collectors?"
    gt "“塞缪尔·哈珀”？没听说过，蠢货。谁他妈认识那些挂满勋章的收藏家啊？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4445
translate schinese main22_583a4aa8:

    # c "Hold your breath while you aim."
    c "瞄准的时候屏住呼吸。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4448
translate schinese main22_0297fa45:

    # g "Huh?"
    g "嗯？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4449
translate schinese main22_04be0863:

    # c "The gun... it's swaying with each breath. Hold your breath while you line up the shot."
    c "枪……随着每一次呼吸在晃动。瞄准的时候屏住呼吸。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4450
translate schinese main22_6f0203a1:

    # g "Really?"
    g "真的吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4451
translate schinese main22_7ed6fa7a:

    # c "It's in like... every FPS with a sniper rifle."
    c "这可是……所有带狙击步枪的FPS游戏里的标配。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4452
translate schinese main22_ac4221cc:

    # g "Ah yes, those FPSes I'm such a fan of. Chloe, I don't even know what an FPS is."
    g "噢是啊，那些我“特别爱玩”的FPS游戏。克洛伊，我甚至都不知道FPS是什么。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4453
translate schinese main22_b436fe73:

    # g "Uh... firepower simulator."
    g "呃……火力模拟器。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4454
translate schinese main22_0c369ff0:

    # c "First-person shooter."
    c "第一人称射击游戏。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4455
translate schinese main22_7d2cc577:

    # g "Only the first? Do you stab the other people or something? Seems like a weird gimmick but okay."
    g "只有“第一”人称吗？难道还要去捅别人之类的？听起来是个挺奇怪的噱头，不过也行吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4458
translate schinese main22_6d2b2825:

    # g "Okay, holding my breath."
    g "好了，屏住呼吸。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4461
translate schinese main22_ae928758:

    # gt "Woah... it {i}was{/i} the breathing..."
    gt "哇……原来关键在于{i}呼吸{/i}啊……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4462
translate schinese main22_63a05388:

    # gt "I might be able to actually land a few shots like this."
    gt "说不定我真能像这样命中几发。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4463
translate schinese main22_f0ee2cea:

    # gt "What am I even gonna do with that necklace? I can't wear that shit in public, unlike the people here I'm not actually mansion hopping every day."
    gt "那条项链我到底能拿来干嘛？我又不能戴着那玩意儿招摇过市——毕竟我可不像这儿的那些人，天天在豪宅之间流连应酬。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4470
translate schinese main22_ad56e5cf:

    # gt "W-what?"
    gt "什、什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4476
translate schinese main22_074eba5e:

    # gt "Is that..."
    gt "那是……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4505
translate schinese main22_28d87b3e:

    # MCt "All's quiet on this front."
    MCt "这一带很安静。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4506
translate schinese main22_0a1dd8bd:

    # MCt "I guess I'm looking for... paths into other areas of the palace and... medical records."
    MCt "我想我是在找……通往宫殿其他区域的路径，还有……医疗记录。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4507
translate schinese main22_5dbf76ec:

    # MCt "They might have something on Hugo and... well... {b}Clement{/b}..."
    MCt "他们可能掌握了关于雨果和……嗯……{b}克莱门特{/b}的什么把柄……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4513
translate schinese main22_5d3e0e32:

    # MCt "The sooner we get this done the better, I haven't even had a second to enjoy the party. I'm starting to worry that I won't at all..."
    MCt "这事儿越早搞定越好，我甚至还没来得及享受一下派对呢。我开始担心自己根本没机会享受了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4514
translate schinese main22_fdfc5f65:

    # MCt "I haven't spent any time with Grace either, though it's nice to see her spending time with Chloe if anything, I rarely see Grace alone with her sisters."
    MCt "我也没怎么陪格蕾丝，不过看到她和克洛伊待在一起倒也不错——毕竟我很少见格蕾丝单独和她的姐妹们相处。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4515
translate schinese main22_e58f3e71:

    # MCt "Actually... I don't see those three together often anyway... I guess all sibling relationships are different."
    MCt "其实……我本来就很少见她们三个聚在一起……我想，每对姐妹的关系都不一样吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4516
translate schinese main22_ab747bf2:

    # MCt "Medical journals, administrative paperwork, chemicals... nothing."
    MCt "医学期刊、行政文件、化学试剂……什么都没有。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4517
translate schinese main22_696604ab:

    # MCt "*Sigh* I came here out of the goodness of my heart and look at me, spending the whole night paranoid about Clement."
    MCt "*叹气* 我本来是出于好心才来这儿的，结果呢？我却整晚都在提心吊胆，满脑子想的都是克莱门特。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4518
translate schinese main22_d7ffdbc6:

    # MCt "Who am I kidding? I'm not investigating to find dirt on Hugo..."
    MCt "我这是在自欺欺人吗？我调查根本不是为了挖雨果的黑料……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4519
translate schinese main22_1e030102:

    # MCt "I'm the only one who sees something in Clement, but I {i}know{/i} it's real."
    MCt "只有我能察觉到克莱门特身上的某种特质，但我{i}知道{/i}那是真实存在的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4520
translate schinese main22_14ddd374:

    # MCt "It {i}has{/i} to have something to do with me... It's like... the opposite of what I felt when I met Cadence... but the same flavor."
    MCt "这肯定{i}和{/i}我有关……那种感觉就像是……当初遇见凯登丝时的反面……但却是同一种味道。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4521
translate schinese main22_ae91fa96:

    # MCt "It's like some kind of otherworldly force is bringing us together. Or in the case of Clement... telling me to run away."
    MCt "就像是有某种超自然的力量在把我们拉到一起。或者就克莱门特的情况而言……是在警告我赶紧逃跑。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4524
translate schinese main22_d26733b3:

    # MCt "It's not all bad, I can't remember the last time I felt like I was so... uh... part of something?"
    MCt "也不全是坏事，我都记不清上次感觉自己……呃……真正融入某个群体是什么时候了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4525
translate schinese main22_ed1c9937:

    # MCt "It's kinda fun being on a mission of sorts, especially as a part of a team, like some special ops shit."
    MCt "执行某种任务还挺有意思的，尤其是作为团队的一员——就像那种特种作战行动一样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4526
translate schinese main22_35e72db7:

    # MCt "An actual friend circle, more stuff to actually do with Grace and somehow Chloe."
    MCt "有了真正的朋友圈，能和格蕾丝——还有克洛伊——一起做更多实际的事情。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4528
translate schinese main22_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4529
translate schinese main22_a5312b66:

    # MCt "C-Chloe..."
    MCt "克……克洛伊……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4530
translate schinese main22_b2684e5a:

    # MCt "That's... gonna have to be something we talk about..."
    MCt "那件事……看来我们得找个时间谈谈了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4531
translate schinese main22_971b95db:

    # MCt "I... hmm... There's no use pretending it's something else..."
    MCt "我……嗯……再怎么自欺欺人也没用了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4532
translate schinese main22_d8ba0e35:

    # MCt "She definitely likes me... she's warmed up to me a lot but..."
    MCt "她绝对是喜欢我的……她对我的态度亲近了许多，可是……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4533
translate schinese main22_2c91be37:

    # MCt "Fuck! Why am I trying to wrestle with thoughts right now? It was a kiss! What else does it mean?!"
    MCt "该死！我现在干嘛还要纠结这些想法？那可是个吻啊！除了那个还能意味着什么？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4534
translate schinese main22_ea8e48df:

    # MCt "She was so light and cute, her lips delicate and soft, but the way she pulled into me and held on..."
    MCt "她的身子那么轻盈可爱，嘴唇柔软细腻，但她紧紧贴向我、搂住我的那种感觉……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4536
translate schinese main22_0b619555:

    # MCt "Wait..."
    MCt "等等……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4537
translate schinese main22_8dd6ab00:

    # MCt "Uh-oh..."
    MCt "糟了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4538
translate schinese main22_5b80a8c5:

    # MCt "What about Stella?! Oh shit... Normally, I'd be happy about kissing two cute girls but..."
    MCt "那斯特拉怎么办？！该死……按理说，能亲到两个可爱的女孩我应该很高兴才对，但是……"

