    MCt "刚才说到哪儿了？哦，文件。希望这里能找到我需要的东西。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4637
translate schinese m22afterchoice1_8aa5c352:

    # MCt "It's kinda breezy in here, huh? I guess summer is on its way out, I wonder if we'll get any more rain this year..."
    MCt "这儿风有点大，是吧？看来夏天快要过去了，不知道今年还会不会下雨……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4638
translate schinese m22afterchoice1_b2b82cd0:

    # MCt "Do we have any birthdays coming up? I never actually asked Cadence when hers is."
    MCt "最近有什么人生日吗？我其实从来没问过凯登丝她的生日是哪天。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4639
translate schinese m22afterchoice1_df46e33b:

    # MCt "Grace and Noelle are both in December... Chloe turned eighteen in June... Ugh, that's a lot of presents... Now we add Cadence, my new friends, Stella... I'm gonna be seeing a lot of parties..."
    MCt "格蕾丝和诺艾尔都是十二月生日……克洛伊六月刚满十八岁……唉，要准备好多礼物啊……再加上凯登丝、我的新朋友们，还有斯特拉……看来我得参加不少派对了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4640
translate schinese m22afterchoice1_e14b9808:

    # MCt "Wait- breezy?"
    MCt "等等——有风？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4643
