    # MC "What in the fresh fuck are you doing here, Miya?! Are you insane?! What if you were caught?!!"
    MC "你到底在搞什么鬼，米娅？！你疯了吗？！万一被抓住了怎么办？！！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4706
translate schinese m22afterchoice1_8bcc8ebc:

    # m "Well, I wasn't caught, was I?"
    m "哎呀，反正我没被抓住，不是吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4707
translate schinese m22afterchoice1_881505e5:

    # MC "How?!"
    MC "怎么做到的？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4708
translate schinese m22afterchoice1_75e261db:

    # m "I saw a guard, I went the other way, I saw a camera, I went the other way. It's not hard!"
    m "看到守卫，我就绕道走；看到监控摄像头，我也绕道走。这又不难！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:4709
