# game/script2_2.rpyc:7127
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_a5f707d5:

    # MC "Us magicians all understand magic, you can sense it, read it, see it."
    MC "我们这些魔法师都懂魔法，能感知它、解读它、看见它。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7130
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_9a4ccf27:

    # MC "{b}Clement speaks a foreign language{/b}."
    MC "{b}克莱门特说的却是一种外语。{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7131
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_5179b8e5:

    # MC "And it's scary."
    MC "而且这很可怕。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7132
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_ecc34f6e:

    # MC "I don't know if it's the result of advanced occult research, I don't know if he has magical superpowers."
    MC "我不知道这是不是某种高深秘术研究的产物，也不知道他是否拥有某种超凡的魔法力量。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7133
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_68ad4c7f:

    # MC "I-... I think he's dangerous."
    MC "我……我觉得他很危险。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7134
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_718f7454:

    # MC "And this is going to plague my mind until I get answers. Anything. Even if it's something unsatisfying like a branding changing the way his magic presents."
    MC "这个问题会一直困扰着我，直到我找到答案。任何答案都行。哪怕结果不尽如人意，比如某种“烙印”改变了他魔法的呈现方式。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7135
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_ed855aea:

    # MC "I {i}need{/i} to know."
    MC "我{i}必须{/i}弄清楚。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7139
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_888e0c82:

    # MC "M-Miya?"
    MC "米、米娅？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7140
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_42154375:

    # m "I'm a huggy drunk."
    m "我喝醉了喜欢抱人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7147
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_74de108e:

    # MC "R-right..."
    MC "是……是啊……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7148
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_25c28ea6:

    # MC "So... that's it... I want to investigate him because well..."
    MC "所以……就是这样……我想调查他，因为……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7161
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_a171e80b:

    # m "I'm a kissy drunk too."
    m "我喝醉了也喜欢亲人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7168
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_4b5a5f17:

    # MC "H-hey! Are you being serious?"
    MC "喂！你是认真的吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7169
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_027938e8:

    # MC "Oh, who am I kidding? Of course you aren't. I can't believe I let you drag me in here."
    MC "噢，我在自欺欺人什么呢？你当然不是认真的。真不敢相信我竟然被你拉到这儿来了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7172
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_ba790beb:

    # m "You think I can't be serious just because I'm inebriated?"
    m "你觉得我喝醉了就不能认真吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7173
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_fd2e864c:

    # m "I can be hella serious. Watch."
    m "我可是能非常认真的。看着点。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7186
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_d97a488f:

    # m "See."
    m "你看。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7187
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_2d204a49_9:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7188
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_b3f154fc:

    # m "What do your friends think of him?"
    m "你的朋友们怎么看他？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7189
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_9bf3df92:

    # m "Oh, sorry."
    m "噢，抱歉。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7196
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_b3f154fc_1:

    # m "What do your friends think of him?"
    m "你的朋友们怎么看他？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7200
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_2d204a49_10:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7201
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_ba1b9a40:

    # MC "They... uh... no..."
    MC "他们……呃……没……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7202
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_ebc608a6:

    # MC "No one else has mentioned anything."
    MC "没别人提过什么。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7203
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_b669c57d:

    # MC "It seems that... {i}I'm{/i} the only one who notices anything but... I'm {u}not{/u} imagining it. Ron has said it, right? My perception of magic and stuff is different to everyone else's."
    MC "看来……{i}只有我{/i}注意到了这些，不过……我并没有{u}胡思乱想{/u}。罗纳德也这么说过，对吧？我对魔法之类的东西的感知，和别人都不一样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7205
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_015fb718:

    # m "And you think, learning about this man is pertinent to your own nature."
    m "而且你觉得，了解这个人和你自身的本质有关。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7206
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_e543e41b:

    # MC "Wh-"
    MC "什——"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7207
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_f22972f4:

    # m "You think I've lost my ability to read people because of how often I'm on my own?"
    m "你是不是觉得，因为我经常独处，所以就丧失了洞察人心的能力？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7208
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_e4dbfcc9:

    # m "If anything, all the time spent on introspection has made me even {i}more{/i} observant."
    m "恰恰相反，花时间进行自我审视，反而让我变得{i}更加{/i}敏锐了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7209
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_4e657892:

    # m "You've been extremely secretive about this whole magic thing. Not being able to channel magic until recently? I don't buy it, I'm not sure anyone else does either."
    m "关于魔法的事，你一直守口如瓶。说什么直到最近才学会引导魔法？我才不信，估计也没人会信。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7210
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_d77f2027:

    # m "Maybe I believe that you've been unable to use magic until now, but what I don't believe is that you know nothing about why."
    m "也许我相信你之前确实无法使用魔法，但我绝不相信你对其中的原因一无所知。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7213
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_2c7e249b:

    # m "[name]... Tell me. Please. Who {i}are{/i} you? Who's Cadence? Who's Clement."
    m "[name]……告诉我吧。求你了。你{i}到底{/i}是谁？凯登丝是谁？克莱门特又是谁？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7214
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_c9bfd159:

    # m "I want to help you. I want to know that you're the same person I've always known."
    m "我想帮你。我想确认你还是我一直以来认识的那个你。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7215
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_cc6fac6f:

    # m "I'm so worried... about everything... I thought I was overthinking it but, this Clement business, especially after the Cadence fiasco..."
    m "我真的很担心……担心这一切……我本以为是自己想多了，但关于克莱门特的事——尤其是在凯登丝那场风波之后……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7216
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_29c194ea:

    # m "I don't know what to think anymore."
    m "我现在真的不知道该怎么想了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7217
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_628e4aa3:

    # m "People keep saying you're a special magician or whatever, that you have a high aptitude."
    m "大家都说你是个特别的魔法师之类的，说你天赋极高。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7218
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_efb295c1:

    # m "But that's not it, is it? Please just tell me the truth. You said magic is like a language but... {u}you speak that foreign language too, don't you?{/u}"
    m "但事实并非如此，对吧？求你告诉我真相吧。你说魔法就像一种语言，但是……{u}你也会说那种外语，对吧？{/u}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7221
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_d4ce6477:

    # MC "...Miya..."
    MC "……米娅……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7222
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_6fe85118:

    # MC "...How?"
    MC "……你是怎么做到的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7223
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_f359680f:

    # MC "How can I lie after that? I mean, I didn't expect to hide it forever, but I was wrestling with {i}how{/i} I was going to explain it."
    MC "事已至此，我怎么还能撒谎呢？其实，我没指望能永远瞒着，但我一直在纠结该{i}怎么{/i}解释。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7224
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_f815a038:

    # MC "Or rather... I wanted more answers myself..."
    MC "或者该说……我自己也想弄清楚真相……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7225
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_7e5defe1:

    # m "[name]... honey..."
    m "[name]……亲爱的……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7226
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_f1debadc:

    # MC "Until... well... until I recently started casting spells... I..."
    MC "直到……嗯……直到最近我开始施展魔法……我……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7227
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_0de3657f:

    # MC "*Sigh* You're the first person I'm telling this..."
    MC "*叹气* 你是第一个听我说这些的人……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7228
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_7b6ebe0f:

    # MC "I {b}didn't know that magic existed.{/b}"
    MC "我{b}根本不知道魔法的存在。{/b}"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7229
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_36038944:

    # m "W-what? How can that-"
    m "什、什么？这怎么可能——"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7230
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_33ee0a36:

    # MC "Take away the magic. Take away anyone who isn't a human, rearrange a few parts of the world."
    MC "去掉魔法，去掉非人类的生物，再稍微重组一下世界格局。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7231
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_24fd29e1:

    # MC "That was my universe. That's why I'm acting like I was willfully ignorant of magic. Because I just {i}was{/i} ignorant of it."
    MC "那才是我的世界。所以我才表现得好像是故意对魔法视而不见一样。因为我当时确实是{i}一无所知{/i}。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7232
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_7afa27ef:

    # MC "I don't know what happened. I really don't, I can't go deeper than that."
    MC "我不知道发生了什么。我真的没法再深入了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7233
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_4c7bda7b:

    # MC "Am I in an alternate universe? Did I swap with the me from this universe? Did this world of magic form around me? Was it always there?"
    MC "我是在平行宇宙里吗？我和这个世界的“我”互换了吗？这个魔法世界是因我而生的吗？还是说它一直都在这里？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7234
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_07e766ef:

    # MC "Was I summoned? Is this a natural phenomenon? Are there more people like me? Clement? Liliana?"
    MC "我是被召唤来的吗？这是一种自然现象吗？还有像我这样的人吗？克莱门特？莉莉安娜？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7237
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_f40c577b:

    # MC "I'm scared, I'm... frustrated! I'm tired."
    MC "我很害怕，我……很沮丧！我累了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7238
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_ef487649:

    # MC "I {i}need{/i} answers, but I want to run away at the same time. I don't know what to do. I don't know what I {i}am{/i} doing."
    MC "我{i}需要{/i}答案，但同时也想逃跑。我不知道该怎么办。我不知道自己在{i}做什么{/i}。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7239
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_d12fae39:

    # MC "I don't know if I'm the same person I once was, I don't know if the world I'm in is the same as it once was. Are my memories real? Am {i}I{/i} real?"
    MC "我不知道自己还是不是以前的那个我，也不知道身处的世界是否还是原来的那个世界。我的记忆是真的吗？{i}我{/i}是真的吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7242
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_48539e5b:

    # m "Oh, baby, stop!"
    m "噢，宝贝，别这样！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7243
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_0671f7e5:

    # m "Oh no, you're shaking!"
    m "天哪，你在发抖！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7244
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_79604c41:

    # MC "S-sorry. I've never told-"
    MC "对、对不起。我从来没跟人说过——"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7247
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_ba0e4fbd:

    # m "Shh shh shh shh shh. It's okay, it's okay."
    m "嘘——嘘——嘘——嘘——嘘。没关系，没关系。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7250
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_b074862b:

    # m "You're you."
    m "你就是你自己。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7251
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_afd739e3:

    # m "You're definitely you. I'd bet my life on it. Don't forget that I have a lifetime of memories too."
    m "你绝对就是你。我敢拿命担保。别忘了，我也拥有关于你的一生回忆。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7252
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_5796dbb3:

    # m "And the person in those memories, and the one in front of me right now are one and the same."
    m "那些回忆里的人，和此刻站在我面前的你，就是同一个人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7253
translate schinese m22afterchoice8_2d204a49_11:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:7254
