    # ch "I thought Grace said you were drunk. We're you just pretending or something?"
    ch "我以为格蕾丝说你喝醉了。你刚才是在装醉还是怎么的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8409
translate schinese m22aftermiya_8c48591b:

    # m "I don't know {i}what{/i} happened. I went from like, a-hundred-percent to zero over the course of a minute."
    m "我也不知道{i}到底{/i}出了什么事。大概就一分钟的功夫，我的状态从百分之百一下子掉到了零。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8410
translate schinese m22aftermiya_f887c2fc:

    # m "I didn't drink anything anyway. Toxic fumes? I dunno. Wasn't normal drunk, ergo wasn't a normal sobering."
    m "反正我什么酒都没喝。是有毒气体？我也不清楚。那不是一般的醉酒，所以醒酒的过程也不寻常。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8411
