    # m "Anyway-"
    m "总之——"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8412
translate schinese m22aftermiya_1eb280d9:

    # m "After the modelling gig I kind of meandered between work, up until two years ago I spent just about eight years as a stenographer."
    m "做完模特那份工之后，我的职业生涯有点兜兜转转；直到两年前，我当了大概八年的速记员。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8413
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ddb24376:

    # a "You know stenography?"
    a "你会速记？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8414
translate schinese m22aftermiya_a727664b:

    # m "Mmhm. Practiced it for about a year before I got scouted. Took about six months to get back up to speed."
    m "嗯。被星探发掘之前练过一年左右。后来又花了大概六个月才找回手感。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8415
translate schinese m22aftermiya_2ef33ce7:

    # m "Pays a lot better than you'd expect."
    m "那行的收入比你想象的要高得多。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8416
translate schinese m22aftermiya_c2579cda:

    # m "How about you guys, any plans for your degrees?"
    m "你们呢？对自己的学位有什么打算吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8417
translate schinese m22aftermiya_46c27f72:

    # ma "Please don't ask the hard questions... everyone does a degree nowadays because it's just something to do."
    ma "别问这种让人为难的问题……如今大家都在读学位，纯粹是因为没别的事可做。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8418
translate schinese m22aftermiya_c142b0b5:

    # ch "Yeah, we have absolutely zero ambition or faith in the quality of our futures."
    ch "是啊，我们既没什么雄心壮志，也不觉得未来会有什么好光景。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8419
translate schinese m22aftermiya_a0b56a55:

    # a "The teachers told me I'd need a degree, I was never wise enough to ask \"what for?\"."
    a "老师说我需要个学位，我当时也没那么聪明，没问过一句“到底是为了什么”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8430
translate schinese m22aftermiya_401f6e07:

    # m "Ahaha! Okay! How long have you guys been friends?! I know [name] only met you recently and all..."
    m "哈哈！好吧！你们认识多久了？虽然我才刚认识[name]没多久……"

