    # MC "He said I need to visit his study at midnight... I... think he knows why I couldn't control magic until recently..."
    MC "他说我得在午夜去他的书房……我……觉得他知道为什么我直到最近才学会控制魔法……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8456
translate schinese m22aftermiya_bd0effaf:

    # g "Jeez, talk about ominous... I don't like it one bit... I'm coming with you. A-hundred-percent!"
    g "天哪，听起来真不妙……我一点也不喜欢这样……我要跟你一起去。绝对要去！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8457
translate schinese m22aftermiya_63f0bcc9:

    # g "Why didn't you tell me this guy was bothering you?"
    g "你为什么没告诉我这家伙在骚扰你？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8458
translate schinese m22aftermiya_9b8f3eee:

    # MC "Sorry... we haven't managed to find any time together... I was with Chloe, then Ashley."
    MC "抱歉……我们一直没能抽出时间聚聚……我先是和克洛伊在一起，后来又和阿什莉在一起。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8459
translate schinese m22aftermiya_88d779f8:

    # g "Boo, when midnight comes along it's totally my turn to be on your team."
    g "嘿，到了午夜，绝对该轮到我加入你的队伍了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8460
translate schinese m22aftermiya_518f4014:

    # c "I'm coming too."
    c "我也要去。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8461
translate schinese m22aftermiya_02250d1c:

    # g "You don't want her, {i}I'm{/i} the one who punches like a Mantis Shrimp."
    g "你不要她，{i}我才是{/i}那个出拳像螳螂虾一样的人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8462
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ff35c188:

    # MC "Let me go alone... this is about me..."
    MC "让我一个人去吧……这是我自己的事……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8463
translate schinese m22aftermiya_f6613841:

    # MC "Also... I think... well, I can't be certain but... I think I can trust him... he says I'll be killed without him... also..."
    MC "还有……我觉得……嗯，虽然不能百分之百确定……但我认为可以信任他……他说如果没有他，我会没命的……而且……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8464
translate schinese m22aftermiya_80c02405:

    # MC "He snuck up on me... I was conscious of his presence all night and then... I had no idea he was there, right next to me..."
    MC "他悄悄靠近了我……我整晚都能感觉到他的存在，可后来……我竟然完全没察觉到他就站在我身边……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8465
translate schinese m22aftermiya_d0be715d:

    # MC "Maybe he was just making a statement, making his presence known, or it could've been something like echolocation to find me... I have no idea but..."
    MC "也许他只是想宣示一下存在感，或者用了类似回声定位的方法来找我……我也不清楚，但是……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8466
translate schinese m22aftermiya_a92dc39c:

    # MC "I need to go... he wouldn't talk about me like that unless he {i}really{/i} knew something. If he wanted me dead, I wouldn't have made it out of that room."
    MC "我得走了……如果不是{i}真的{/i}掌握了什么情况，他不会那样谈论我。要是他真想杀我，我根本不可能活着走出那个房间。"

