    g "没事的。我会去的。我就在外面等你，好吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8472
translate schinese m22aftermiya_5bf7af9d:

    # "Every segment of Grace's demeanor stands firm, oozing with reassurance and confidence, her hand cradling yours to tell you that everything will be fine."
    "格蕾丝的神态坚定沉稳，透着让人安心的自信；她握着你的手，仿佛在告诉你一切都会好起来的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8473
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ad289add:

    # "Alas, a faint tremble in her grip, even for the nearly-imperceptible instant of its existence, shatters any facade she holds so confidently in front of her."
    "然而，她握着你的手却微微颤抖了一下——尽管那颤抖转瞬即逝，几乎难以察觉，却瞬间击碎了她那自信满满的伪装。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8474
translate schinese m22aftermiya_b1954c64:

    # "Still, she boldly smiles at you. Her warm expression full of familiar boyish energy. Grace is worried, but she's still Grace."
    "尽管如此，她还是勇敢地向你微笑。那温暖的神情中，满是她那像男孩子一样充满活力的气息。格蕾丝虽然担心，但她依然是格蕾丝。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8478
translate schinese m22aftermiya_c50a7f1c:

    # c "Y-you're going to be fine... t-this is a good thing... I think..."
    c "你……你会没事的……这……这是件好事……我想……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8479
translate schinese m22aftermiya_6b3c94b8:

    # c "Finally s-some answers... and stuff..."
    c "终于能得到些……答案了……之类的……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8480
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ca87ebdf:

    # c "And... I'll be there too."
    c "而且……我也会陪着你的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8481
translate schinese m22aftermiya_53401de5:

    # MC "...Chloe..."
    MC "……克洛伊……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8482
translate schinese m22aftermiya_c2ccac43:

    # "While unsurprising, Chloe's hand tremors similarly to her big sister's. What {i}is{/i} surprising, however, is her assertive outburst."
    "虽然并不令人意外，但克洛伊的手也像她姐姐那样微微颤抖着。然而，{i}令人惊讶的是{/i}她那斩钉截铁的表态。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8483
translate schinese m22aftermiya_0ece782c:

    # "Despite possessing few talents and negligible interpersonal skills, she, without hesitation, offers herself as support."
    "尽管没什么特长，人际交往能力也乏善可陈，她却毫不犹豫地提出要提供协助。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8484
translate schinese m22aftermiya_10f8c6af:

    # "Neither of you know what she could possibly offer, yet both of you know it doesn't matter."
    "你们俩都不知道她究竟能帮上什么忙，但也都知道这并不重要。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8492
translate schinese m22aftermiya_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8497
translate schinese m22aftermiya_a02a02ca:

    # g "{b}We'll{/b} tackle this together, [name], like {b}we{/b} always do!"
    g "{b}我们{/b}一起解决这个问题，[name]，就像{b}我们{/b}一贯做的那样！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8498
translate schinese m22aftermiya_6de0d77c:

    # g "Chloe can tag along."
    g "克洛伊可以跟来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8502
translate schinese m22aftermiya_57dde324:

    # c "{i}Chloe{/i} made a deal with him to investigate everything together tonight."
    c "{i}克洛伊{/i}和他约好了，今晚要一起调查所有事情。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8503
translate schinese m22aftermiya_a5093adf:

    # g "Hence why you can tag along, leave all the fun stuff to {i}us{/i}."
    g "所以你可以跟来，把那些有趣的事留给{i}我们{/i}。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8504
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ed2610b4:

    # c "He {i}needs{/i} me so he knows that everything is safe."
    c "他{i}需要{/i}我在场，这样他才能确信一切安全无虞。"

