    # g "What are you, a canary?"
    g "你以为你是金丝雀吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8506
translate schinese m22aftermiya_193368fc:

    # c "We protect each other! That's what we do! You don't need protecting so you won't understand!"
    c "我们互相守护！这就是我们的行事准则！你不需要被保护，所以你不会懂的！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8507
translate schinese m22aftermiya_1e7267ec:

    # g "Hey! You don't need to be codependent to have an unbreakable bond!"
    g "嘿！要建立牢不可破的羁绊，并不非得互相依赖不可！"

