    # m "You're just so cute!"
    m "你真是太可爱了！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8559
translate schinese m22aftermiya_d19f855d_1:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8562
translate schinese m22aftermiya_25b806a8:

    # g "Keep a lookout for this guy who's been gunning for me and Chloe."
    g "留意一下那个一直找我和克洛伊麻烦的家伙。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8563
translate schinese m22aftermiya_726ce14b:

    # MC "You pissed someone off?"
    MC "你惹到谁了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8564
translate schinese m22aftermiya_6463c3a2:

    # g "It's not {i}our{/i} fault, he's just a baby and a sore loser. It's the guy who lost to Chloe at the range. Fancies himself some kind of legendary collector, he's obsessed with the necklace he lost out on."
    g "这又不怪我们，那家伙就是个输不起的幼稚鬼。就是那个在靶场输给克洛伊的家伙。他自以为是什么传奇收藏家，对那条输掉的项链念念不忘。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8565
translate schinese m22aftermiya_51faa98d:

    # g "He screwed Chloe over in blackjack and then tried blackmailing her for the necklace. We won't give it to him or anything but, keep an eye on him so nothing bad happens."
    g "他在二十一点里坑了克洛伊一把，然后还试图勒索她，想把项链弄到手。我们不会把那个东西给他的，不过还是得盯着他点，免得出什么岔子。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8566
translate schinese m22aftermiya_411bb418:

    # g "Oh, and absolutely don't do anything that'll let him track us after the party. I'm pretty sure he still doesn't know our names."
    g "还有，千万别做什么让他能在派对结束后追踪到我们的事。我敢肯定，他到现在还不知道我们的名字。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8567
translate schinese m22aftermiya_56c9fbde:

    # MC "Got it."
    MC "明白了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8568
translate schinese m22aftermiya_882ba4d9:

