    a "去你的！我才{i}不{/i}会去勾引他！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8610
translate schinese m22aftermiya_407e5617:

    # MC "The whole reason he threw this party is that he could find someone to plant his seed in. Judging by his lack of charisma, and that everyone else at this place is just as rich as he is, he's going to be a pushover."
    MC "他举办这场派对，就是为了找个女人来怀上他的种。看他那毫无魅力的样子，再加上这儿的其他人都跟他一样有钱，他肯定很好搞定。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8611
translate schinese m22aftermiya_012c49d5:

    # a "But then..."
    a "可是……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8612
translate schinese m22aftermiya_b04d64fe:

    # MC "No. You don't have to actually {i}do{/i} anything, just do one of those \"wanna go somewhere private?\" routines."
    MC "不，你其实不需要真的做什么，只要使出那套“要不要去个私密的地方？”的套路就行了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8613
