# game/script2_2.rpyc:8808
translate schinese m22aftermiya_15cdd458:

    # MC "Please, I'm trying to take the high ground but it's very slippery up here."
    MC "拜托，我正努力保持高姿态呢，但这上面滑得很。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8812
translate schinese m22aftermiya_55ded602:

    # MC "Go say something abrasive to him."
    MC "去跟他说点难听的话吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8815
translate schinese m22aftermiya_366ffc68:

    # g "Sure."
    g "当然。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8816
translate schinese m22aftermiya_64e8fa12:

    # a "Huh... really? I thought for sure I'd have to bargain or something."
    a "哈……真的吗？我还以为肯定得讨价还价一番呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8817
translate schinese m22aftermiya_54423fcb:

    # g "Nah, I just gotta hide in a room naked for a little while, give me a bag of Cheetos and it'll feel just like home."
    g "不用，我只要光着身子在房间里躲一会儿就行——再给我一包奇多（Cheetos），感觉就跟在家里一样了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8818
translate schinese m22aftermiya_63343f28:

    # g "When is it going down?"
    g "打算什么时候动手？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8819
translate schinese m22aftermiya_029b1631:

    # a "Uhh... well... that's a problem... I was just thinking about that and how we're going to get around it..."
    a "呃……这个嘛……确实是个问题……我刚才也在琢磨这事儿，想着该怎么绕开他……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8820
translate schinese m22aftermiya_1beafafb:

    # a "I don't know if you've noticed but he's had this guy hovering around him all night."
    a "不知道你注意到了没，有个家伙整晚都像影子一样跟着他。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8821
translate schinese m22aftermiya_8fd8fc0a:

    # g "Guy? You mean Clement?"
    g "家伙？你是说克莱门特？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8822
translate schinese m22aftermiya_2acbad95:

    # a "Yeah- you know him?"
    a "对——你认识他？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8823
translate schinese m22aftermiya_2735c776:

    # g "Oh yeah, huge Clement fan. Got all his albums."
    g "噢，对，我是克莱门特的超级粉丝，他的专辑我全都有。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8824
translate schinese m22aftermiya_82c3707b:

    # a "Anyway, I'm guessing mommy and daddy told Clement to make extra sure that their baby boy is safe all night."
    a "总之，我猜肯定是他的“好爸爸好妈妈”叮嘱过克莱门特，让他务必确保宝贝儿子整晚都安然无恙。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8825
translate schinese m22aftermiya_c1940ef2:

    # a "Which means I'm a little worried about the prospect of him following us. Even if he waits outside the room it'll make escape impossible once things turn sour."
    a "所以我有点担心他会跟着我们。就算他只在房间外守着，一旦情况有变，我们也根本没法逃脱。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8826
translate schinese m22aftermiya_0b96ca09:

    # g "Oh, that shouldn't be a problem. Clement has to go to his study at eleven-thirty. All we gotta do is match our timings."
    g "噢，那应该不是问题。克莱门特十一点半得去书房。我们只要把时间对好就行了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8827
translate schinese m22aftermiya_89805424:

    # a "What? How do you know that?"
    a "什么？你是怎么知道的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8828
translate schinese m22aftermiya_79cf15cf:

    # g "[name] got it out of an employee."
    g "[name]是从一个员工那里套出话来的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8829
translate schinese m22aftermiya_4b5f2526:

    # a "*Sigh* I really owe him."
    a "*叹气* 我真欠他一个人情。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8830
translate schinese m22aftermiya_b8ed9015:

    # g "Eh, you'll learn pretty soon how selfless he can be. I'm starting to think he has a savior complex or something, or maybe he's just super nice, who knows?"
    g "嘿，你很快就会见识到他有多无私了。我开始觉得他是不是有什么“救世主情结”之类的，或者也许他就是个超级好人，谁知道呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8831
translate schinese m22aftermiya_25c5f207:

    # a "Cool, so we still have almost two hours left."
    a "太好了，那我们还有差不多两个小时。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8836
translate schinese m22aftermiya_18320543:

    # m "Ayo, my pussy don't work no more so kids are impossible."
    m "哎呀，我下面已经用不了了，所以生孩子是不可能的喽。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8847
translate schinese m22aftermiya_3e2b8246:

    # g "We'll do it in a little while, we still have time. But the idea is that Clement will be busy in his study."
    g "我们待会儿再做，时间还来得及。不过计划是让克莱门特忙于他在书房里的事。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8848
translate schinese m22aftermiya_3171ee2c:

    # MC "...Not just him..."
    MC "……不光是他……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8849
translate schinese m22aftermiya_4b340443_1:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8850
translate schinese m22aftermiya_159f40ab:

    # g "You sound nervous."
    g "听起来你很紧张。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8851
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ecc17a86:

    # MC "Can you blame me? I got told my life is in danger, by someone I have {i}no{/i} reason to trust."
    MC "这能怪我吗？有人告诉我，我的生命正面临危险——可我{i}根本{/i}没有理由去相信他。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8852
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ab66984b:

    # MC "The only thing I can't deny is that he knows something... regardless of if he's a good guy or a bad guy, the feeling he was giving me, and the fact that he singled me out..."
    MC "唯一无法否认的是，他确实知道些什么……无论他是好人还是坏人，他给我的那种感觉，以及他偏偏找上我这一点……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8853
translate schinese m22aftermiya_cf9c49a2:

    # MC "He proved that something is going on... I can't just pretend he's blowing hot air..."
    MC "他证明了事态确实有些不对劲……我不能仅仅把这当成是他在信口开河……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8856
translate schinese m22aftermiya_d95eb97d:

    # g "...I think he's on your side. Don't ask me why. It's just a hunch, all the pieces fall into place that way."
    g "……我觉得他是站在你这边的。别问我为什么，这只是种直觉，而且把所有线索串联起来看，情况确实如此。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8857
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ac3fa194:

    # g "You said it yourself, he had the chance to do something drastic, instead, he tells you he'll explain everything."
    g "你自己也说了，他本来有机会采取极端行动的，但他没有，反而说会把一切解释清楚。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8858
translate schinese m22aftermiya_7ffaa94e:

    # g "Don't worry about it, it's contagious, okay?"
    g "别担心了，这种情绪是会传染的，好吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8859
translate schinese m22aftermiya_4b340443_2:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8862
translate schinese m22aftermiya_b334d7f7:

    # g "[name]?"
    g "[name]？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8863
translate schinese m22aftermiya_aae2000c:

    # g "Hey, [name], are you listening?"
    g "嘿，[name]，你在听吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8864
translate schinese m22aftermiya_fed615e5:

    # g "[name], come on."
    g "[name]，回回神吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8867
translate schinese m22aftermiya_bb804576:

    # MC "...Sorry... just... got a lot on my mind..."
    MC "……抱歉……只是……我心里想的事情太多了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8868
translate schinese m22aftermiya_4b340443_3:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8871
translate schinese m22aftermiya_52af7520:

    # g "We're wasting our time."
    g "我们在浪费时间。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8872
translate schinese m22aftermiya_98ea689f:

    # MC "Grace? What's going on?"
    MC "格蕾丝？怎么了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8873
translate schinese m22aftermiya_c3135d30:

    # g "Dance with me!"
    g "跟我跳支舞吧！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8874
translate schinese m22aftermiya_dd1fe346:

    # MC "Got a problem with me wallowing in unfettered anxiety?"
    MC "对我沉溺于这种无止境的焦虑有什么意见吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8875
translate schinese m22aftermiya_f8b719dd:

    # g "Countless problems. Let's not talk about them, I don't want {i}anyone{/i} thinking about problems right now."
    g "意见多得数不过来。别提那些了，我现在不想让{i}任何人{/i}去想那些麻烦事。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8878
translate schinese m22aftermiya_361d4298:

    # g "Hehe, keep up with me."
    g "嘿嘿，跟上我的节奏。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8879
translate schinese m22aftermiya_58077503:

    # MC "Are you {i}sure{/i} you know what you're doing?"
    MC "你{i}确定{/i}你知道自己在做什么吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8880
translate schinese m22aftermiya_11f9854d:

    # g "Don't you remember me taking dance classes for a couple months?"
    g "你不记得我上过几个月舞蹈课了吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8881
translate schinese m22aftermiya_79c7eeff:

    # MC "Ah, yes, back when you rejected the concept of testosterone, fascinating how you've since embraced it."
    MC "啊，是啊，那时候你还排斥“睾酮”这种概念呢，真有意思，如今你倒是欣然接受了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8882
translate schinese m22aftermiya_1486ff76:

    # g "Phaha! Shut the fuck up! You're just jealous that my balls hang lower than yours."
    g "哈哈！给老子闭嘴！你就是嫉妒我的蛋蛋垂得比你的低。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8885
translate schinese m22aftermiya_5f3025ca:

    # MC "Don't complain if I step on them."
    MC "要是我不小心踩到了，可别抱怨。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8886
translate schinese m22aftermiya_6f1ed714:

    # g "Not a problem if you follow my lead."
    g "只要你跟着我的步调走，就没问题。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8887
translate schinese m22aftermiya_e7460b40:

    # MC "Relax, I know how to dance."
    MC "放轻松，我会跳舞的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8888
translate schinese m22aftermiya_08178179:

    # g "*Sigh* ...Why?..."
    g "*叹气*……为什么啊……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8891
translate schinese m22aftermiya_9e523387:

    # g "You're literally a jack of all trades, it's disgusting."
    g "你简直什么都会，真让人受不了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8892
translate schinese m22aftermiya_e332d705:

    # g "Save some of that skill for those of us that actually put in the work, will you?"
    g "留点本事给我们这些真正努力过的人吧，好吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8893
translate schinese m22aftermiya_6367eb83:

    # MC "Sorry... I'm also preemptively apologizing for out-lifting you after three gym sessions."
    MC "抱歉……我得先道个歉，因为才练了三次，我的举重成绩可能就要超过你了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8894
translate schinese m22aftermiya_05c26a44:

    # g "If that happens I'm actually going to be livid. Not to mention you'll never let me live it down."
    g "要是真发生这种事，我绝对会气炸的。更别提你肯定会拿这事儿没完没了地取笑我。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8895
translate schinese m22aftermiya_85f66040:

    # MC "Eh, my abilities aren't transcendent. I suck at billiards, creative writing, and I'm only ranked eighty-first in the world for underwater basket weaving."
    MC "呃，我的本事也没那么神啦。我台球打得很烂，创意写作也不行，而且在“水下编篮子”这项运动上，我的世界排名才第八十一。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8896
translate schinese m22aftermiya_f65c34a9:

    # g "Why do you know how to dance, anyway?"
    g "话说回来，你到底是怎么学会跳舞的？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8897
translate schinese m22aftermiya_6297ee02:

    # MC "I got distracted while eating cookies and accidentally watched a three-hour video essay on ballroom dancing."
    MC "我当时正吃着饼干，结果分了神，不小心看了一部关于交谊舞的长达三小时的视频解析。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8898
translate schinese m22aftermiya_e74794f9:

    # g "Please swap those cookies for Ritalin next time..."
    g "下次请把那些曲奇换成利他林……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8901
translate schinese m22aftermiya_94cbd9fa:

    # MC "How's your rhythm?"
    MC "你的节奏感如何？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8902
translate schinese m22aftermiya_d473f871:

    # g "My rhythm's just fine."
    g "我的节奏感挺好的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8905
translate schinese m22aftermiya_9f1f9302:

    # MC "Footwork's good too."
    MC "步法也不错。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8906
translate schinese m22aftermiya_c2f62b54:

    # g "Oh, come on. {i}I'm{/i} the athlete here, I don't think me being coordinated needs mentioning."
    g "哎呀，拜托。我可是个运动员，身体协调性好那是理所当然的，根本不用特意提吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8909
translate schinese m22aftermiya_b61a4791:

    # g "This is nice, just, stepping back and dancing with my best friend."
    g "这种感觉真好——暂时抛开一切，和最好的朋友一起跳舞。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8910
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ccbe0b9d:

    # g "Really lets me appreciate what I've got. I don't really care about the hectic last few hours, or even the hectic next few."
    g "这让我真正体会到了自己所拥有的一切。过去几个小时的忙乱，甚至接下来几个小时的忙乱，我都不在乎了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8911
translate schinese m22aftermiya_8f30efeb:

    # g "Maybe I should pick up dancing again. My brain isn't doing any of the work, I'm simply... moving..."
    g "也许我该重新开始跳舞了。我没怎么动脑子，只是……在活动身体……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8912
translate schinese m22aftermiya_2e5f485c:

    # g "You should relax more, your movements are all sloppy and stiff, I don't wanna get my toes crushed."
    g "你应该放松点，你的动作既拖沓又僵硬，我可不想脚趾被踩扁。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8913
translate schinese m22aftermiya_4b340443_4:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8925
translate schinese m22aftermiya_60f065e9:

    # g "One-two-three, one-two-three."
    g "一、二、三，一、二、三。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8926
translate schinese m22aftermiya_96ede38c:

    # MC "I feel like I'm back at kindergarten... what comes after three again?"
    MC "感觉像回到了幼儿园……三后面是几来着？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8929
translate schinese m22aftermiya_d26341ee:

    # g "Hey, do you think we're going to be this close forever?"
    g "嘿，你觉得我们会永远这么亲密吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8930
translate schinese m22aftermiya_1cec47fc:

    # MC "Who knows? I sure hope so."
    MC "谁知道呢？我真心希望如此。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8931
translate schinese m22aftermiya_86000ee8:

    # g "Yeah... me too. I'm not sure I'll ever find someone else who scratches the same itches."
    g "是啊……我也是。我不确定还能不能找到另一个人，能像你那样懂我、契合我。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8932
translate schinese m22aftermiya_35142c86:

    # g "Someone who feels as naturally a part of my life as breathing, someone to dance with."
    g "那种感觉就像呼吸一样自然地融入我生活的人，那个能与我共舞的人。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8933
translate schinese m22aftermiya_30aff13a:

    # g "I..."
    g "我……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8934
translate schinese m22aftermiya_1a1b1b14:

    # g "I struggle to picture a timeline where we aren't like this."
    g "我很难想象没有我们这种关系的未来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8935
translate schinese m22aftermiya_d8d73ec1:

    # g "This is the one. This is the perfect timeline."
    g "就是现在这样。这是完美的时间线。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8936
translate schinese m22aftermiya_594aa0b0:

    # MC "Do you believe in determinism?"
    MC "你相信决定论吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8937
translate schinese m22aftermiya_714232fe:

    # g "In a mysticism way or a Laplace's Demon kind of way?"
    g "是指神秘主义那种，还是“拉普拉斯妖”那种？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8938
translate schinese m22aftermiya_451c4afb:

    # MC "What the fuck?"
    MC "搞什么鬼？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8939
translate schinese m22aftermiya_08a79ca8:

    # g "What?"
    g "什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8940
translate schinese m22aftermiya_96a56bc7:

    # MC "I said the exact same thing to Noelle when she brought it up..."
    MC "诺艾尔提起这事的时候，我也说了同样的话……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8941
translate schinese m22aftermiya_acd7cc58:

    # MC "Stop copying my bars."
    MC "别学我说话。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8942
translate schinese m22aftermiya_289ca10c:

    # MC "And I mean the Laplace's Demon kind of way."
    MC "我是指“拉普拉斯妖”那种。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8943
translate schinese m22aftermiya_bef237a1:

    # g "I {i}do{/i} believe in determinism. Some people find reassurance in believing that they're in full control of their lives, but for me..."
    g "我确实相信决定论。有些人觉得相信自己能完全掌控生活会让他们感到安心，但对我而言……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8944
translate schinese m22aftermiya_de165599:

    # g "There's no greater satisfaction in knowing that no matter how many times you re-roll the universe, no matter how many chances I get, all roads lead to me dancing with you here right now."
    g "最令人满足的莫过于知道，无论宇宙如何重置，无论我有多少次机会，所有的路最终都会指向此时此刻——与你共舞。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8948
translate schinese m22aftermiya_61322c35:

    # g "It's almost perfect."
    g "这近乎完美。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8949
translate schinese m22aftermiya_2981aa89:

    # MC "Almost?"
    MC "近乎？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8950
translate schinese m22aftermiya_43e0ab22:

    # g "If things could be a little different, I wouldn't mind shuffling a few more times..."
    g "如果情况能稍微有些不同，我不介意再多洗几次牌……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8953
translate schinese m22aftermiya_9ea47374:

    # g "I don't know how many more ways I can tell you how much I value you as my friend."
    g "我不知道还能用什么方式告诉你，我有多么珍视你这位朋友。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8954
translate schinese m22aftermiya_edb2f60d:

    # MC "I know... I know."
    MC "我知道……我都知道。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8955
translate schinese m22aftermiya_b65c345e:

    # MC "I feel the same way, Grace. You're invaluable to me in every sense of the word."
    MC "我的感受也一样，格蕾丝。无论从哪个角度来看，你对我而言都是无价的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8956
translate schinese m22aftermiya_2e75006c:

    # g "Invaluable in every sense of the word? Literally?"
    g "“无价之宝”——是字面意义上的那种无价吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8957
translate schinese m22aftermiya_53340401:

    # MC "Yup, I could sell you and live like a king."
    MC "没错，把你卖了，我就能过上像国王一样的生活。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8958
translate schinese m22aftermiya_04732399:

    # MC "But Grace, you don't need to tell me, I don't need to be reminded in any more ways. It's kind of like if your dog could talk, you'd learn nothing new."
    MC "不过格蕾丝，你不用告诉我这些，我也不需要再被反复提醒了。这就像是如果你的狗会说话，你也听不到什么新鲜事儿一样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8959
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ddcb51c4:

    # g "Well... I just really really don't want you to lose sight of what you have."
    g "嗯……我只是真的、真的不希望你忽略了自己所拥有的这一切。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8960
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ffdb2103:

    # g "Whatever else is going on, you have me. If something is worrying you, you have me, if something scares you, you have me."
    g "无论发生什么，你都有我。如果有事让你担心，你有我；如果有事让你害怕，你也有我。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8961
translate schinese m22aftermiya_96601aa3:

    # g "Okay? So you don't need to plague your mind with worries of change and danger, because {i}I{/i} will be a constant."
    g "明白了吗？所以你无需为变故与危险而忧心忡忡，因为{i}我{/i}会始终如一。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8962
translate schinese m22aftermiya_30303b72:

    # MC "Grace..."
    MC "格蕾丝……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8963
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ff6a4aa7:

