    MC "你身上很好闻。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8978
translate schinese m22aftermiya_745ed854:

    # g "Eheh, thank you. I'm not one to wear perfume usually, I kinda get choice paralysis and don't want to smell disproportionately nice considering how I usually under-dress."
    g "嘿嘿，谢谢。我平时不怎么用香水，因为总有选择困难症；而且考虑到我平时穿得那么随意，要是身上太香了会显得有点不搭调。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8979
translate schinese m22aftermiya_1ee3791a:

    # g "But you know, fancy party. Needed to commit fully to the bit."
    g "不过你也知道，这是场高级派对嘛。总得把这身行头和氛围给撑起来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8980
translate schinese m22aftermiya_06b6676c:

    # MC "I think you've over-committed."
    MC "我觉得你有点用力过猛了。"

