    # MC "This is the best you've ever looked. To be honest, I was kinda shocked when you rocked up in that getup, I wasn't sure you had it in you."
    MC "这是你最美的一次。老实说，看到你这身打扮登场时，我真有点惊讶——没想到你竟然能驾驭这种风格。"

