translate schinese m22aftermiya_c51d2fce:

    # MC "Why would you make yourself look like that and then get shy when someone praises you for it?"
    MC "既然把自己打扮得这么漂亮，为什么别人一夸你，你反而害羞起来了呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:8990
translate schinese m22aftermiya_ea3047ed:

    # g "Sh-shut up... I dunno... it just feels... gosh I don't know, okay? It's embarrassing to hear it directly."
    g "闭、闭嘴……我不知道……就是感觉……哎呀我也不知道啦，好吗？被人当面这么夸，怪难为情的。"

