    # "{i}{u}{color=[thatblue]}Mr. ikgbtgkg{/u}{/i}" "What are you talking about? It rolls right off the soft palate."
    "{i}{u}{color=[thatblue]}ikgbtgkg 先生{/u}{/i}" "W你在说什么？它顺滑地从软腭滑出。

