translate schinese m22aftermiya_2b84a0af:

    # "{i}{u}{color=[thatblue]}Mr. ikgbtgkg{/u}{/i}" "I used my tongue for only one of those eight noises, feels a little unfair to the rest of my mouth."
    "{i}{u}{color=[thatblue]}ikgbtgkg 先生{/u}{/i}" "I那八个音里我只用到了舌头，这对口腔的其他部位来说似乎有点不公平。

