translate schinese m22aftermiya_7b571280:

    # g "You too. Get that thing off your face, it's such a generic mask I genuinely think I prefer your unremarkable face."
    g "你也一样。把那玩意儿摘了吧，那面具太大众化了，说真的，我宁愿看你那张平平无奇的脸。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:9234
