    g "我会整晚回味我们刚才做的事。躲在这个房间里，感觉简直棒极了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13521
translate schinese m23replay2_27771040:

    # g "Seriously, it's like a dream come true. Even now I can't stop thinking about when I'm next going to see you. Imagine that, I'm literally excited about just being with you."
    g "说真的，这就像梦想成真一样。哪怕现在，我也忍不住在想下次什么时候能见到你。真不敢相信，光是能和你在一起，我就这么兴奋。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13522
translate schinese m23replay2_1789507d:

    # g "To me. You're perfect. You're everything I need. And I'm so happy that I get to tell you that."
    g "对我而言，你是完美的。你就是我所需要的一切。能把这些告诉你，我真的很高兴。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13528
translate schinese m23replay2_bf132b9b:

    # MC "I had a lot of fun."
    MC "我玩得很开心。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13529
translate schinese m23replay2_a9b42adc:

    # MC "Thanks for loving me. I'll try my best to make up for all the time you spent loving me from the sidelines."
    MC "谢谢你的爱。我会尽我所能，去弥补你过去在旁默默爱我的那些时光。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13530
translate schinese m23replay2_67e23ab4:

    # MC "The status quo has changed, huh? And now we've got a future together like this. There's no going back now."
    MC "情况变了，对吧？如今我们有了这样的未来。再也回不去了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13531
translate schinese m23replay2_ad9e2ecb:

    # g "Sentimentality is going to get us stuck in a loop. {b}You{/b} need to get out of here."
    g "多愁善感只会让我们陷入死循环。{b}你{/b}得离开这儿。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13532
translate schinese m23replay2_7ced830a:

    # MC "Restraint. I'm impressed."
    MC "克制力不错，真让人佩服。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13533
translate schinese m23replay2_fc54155e:

    # g "It's already eating me alive. Quick, get out of here before I turn feral with romance."
    g "这种情感快要把我吞噬了。快走吧，趁我还没因为这浪漫的冲动而变得失控。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13547
translate schinese m23aftergrace_6e570a04:

    # m "I hope you find what you're looking for. Take care of Chloe when you're in there."
    m "希望你能找到你要找的东西。进去之后，照顾好克洛伊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13548
translate schinese m23aftergrace_612df2ea:

    # MC "Don't worry, no one's getting hurt tonight."
    MC "别担心，今晚没人会受伤。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13549
translate schinese m23aftergrace_6fb5918c:

    # m "You need to go now, don't you? We're running out of time before you meet with Clement."
    m "你现在该走了，对吧？你和克莱门特见面的时间快到了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13550
translate schinese m23aftergrace_db1425db:

    # MC "Yeah, we are, what are {i}you{/i} gonna do?"
    MC "是啊，那{i}你{/i}打算怎么办？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13552
translate schinese m23aftergrace_3c77a2ff:

    # m "Not much more time until your fated meeting, is there?"
    m "离你那场命中注定的会面没剩多少时间了，对吧？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13553
translate schinese m23aftergrace_7b29d090:

    # MC "...No... There's going to be a lot of biding from now until then... my mind is swamped..."
    MC "……不……从现在到那时，还得熬上一阵子……我脑子乱成一团了……"

