    # m "Don't you dare get in trouble and end up in a hospital or jail."
    m "你可别惹出什么乱子，最后进了医院或者监狱。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13563
translate schinese m23aftergrace_3688963a:

    # m "[miyai] needs to bounce all on your dick tomorrow. All day."
    m "明天[miyai]要在你那根大肉棒上上下起伏，一整天。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13567
translate schinese m23aftergrace_1ff883bc:

