    # m "Hyperdrive is like crashing an F1 car into my vagina. God of Thunder Mode... I always thought it might kill me."
    m "“超光速模式”（Hyperdrive）就像开着F1赛车撞进我的阴道一样。至于“雷神模式”……我总觉得它可能会要了我的命。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13594
translate schinese m23aftergrace_48b2afa1:

    # MC "Dude, it's a sanctioned sex toy, not a black market weapon. You'll be fine."
    MC "拜托，这可是正规的性玩具，又不是黑市武器。你会没事的。"

