    # m "It's time. It needs to be done. If I don't come back... well... tell everyone I died doing what I love."
    m "时候到了。这事必须得做。如果我没能回来……嗯……告诉大家，我是死在自己热爱的事情上的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13648
translate schinese m23aftergrace_9708444a:

    # m "Thank you. I'll never forget the inspiration you've bestowed upon me. I just need... a little more liquid to ease out the fear."
    m "谢谢你。我永远不会忘记你给予我的启发。我只是需要……再来点酒，好缓解一下心里的恐惧。"

