    # m "I said it's nothing. We're talking about me."
    m "我都说了那没什么大不了的。现在该谈谈我了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13653
translate schinese m23aftergrace_06dda08d:

    # m "Don't worry. I'll be fine. One... three more drinks... then I'll head to the bathroom. I promise, I'll return in one piece."
    m "别担心。我会没事的。再喝……再喝三杯……然后我就去趟洗手间。我保证，我会毫发无损地回来。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:13654
