# game/script2_2.rpyc:14241
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_9febb9b2:

    # c "I'm worried that I'm not going to grow as a person."
    c "我担心自己无法获得成长。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14242
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14243
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_e52cbef4:

    # c "I lack pretty much everything I need to go anywhere. What happens when I get bored of playing video games and sleeping in?"
    c "想要有所作为，我几乎什么都不具备。等我对打游戏和睡懒觉感到厌倦了，该怎么办呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14244
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_2b410895:

    # c "I'm still young but... it scares me how much I don't want to do anything or... that I don't know {i}what{/i} I want to do..."
    c "我还年轻，但……那种“什么都不想做”，或者“不知道{i}什么{/i}才是自己想要的”，让我感到害怕……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14245
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_13b121e7:

    # c "Maybe one day... I'll decide I want a change and... I can't do anything because I left it too late to catch up on life... then I'm stuck where I am."
    c "也许有一天……我会想要改变，却发现为时已晚，再也追不上生活的脚步……然后我就只能被困在原地，动弹不得。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14246
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_515e1f53:

    # c "I've got no ambition and... it scares me. I've got no talents to speak of... no skills..."
    c "我没有什么雄心壮志……这让我很害怕。我也没什么拿得出手的才华……也没什么技能……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14247
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_19b9c827:

    # c "I don't know why I'm here. But it's not like... like I'm looking for a purpose or anything like that..."
    c "我不知道自己为什么会在这里。但这并不是说……不是说我是在寻找什么人生目标之类的东西……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14248
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_b3af61d3:

    # c "I'm just scared that one day I'm going to be trapped, I'll be getting older, I'll have no friends, staying inside watching won't hit the same..."
    c "我只是害怕有一天会被困住：人老了，没有朋友，独自待在屋里看着外面……那种感觉肯定大不相同了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14251
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_7543ea61:

    # c "Huh?"
    c "嗯？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14254
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_88e60a82:

    # c "Why am I telling you all of this?"
    c "我为什么要告诉你这些呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14256
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_6971ff4f:

    # c "I thought for sure I couldn't trust you after you ran away earlier..."
    c "之前你逃走之后，我本来以为绝对不能信任你了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14257
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_845b24ea:

    # c "I haven't even told Neeta about this stuff..."
    c "这些事我连妮塔都没说过……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14258
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_b733b0bc:

    # c "Mmm..."
    c "嗯……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14261
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_ec9c5957:

    # c "Maybe it's because I'm tired. You're mean, taking advantage of a girl when she's too tired to control herself."
    c "也许是因为我累了吧。你真坏，趁着女孩子累得无法控制自己时占便宜。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14262
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_ce707b31:

    # MC "I had no idea that you were tired."
    MC "我完全不知道你累了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14263
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_1324b814:

    # c "I'm {i}always{/i} tired, dumbass."
    c "我{i}一直{/i}都很累，笨蛋。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14264
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_59696516:

    # MC "Really? You looked so healthy today."
    MC "真的吗？你今天看起来气色很好啊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14265
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_59df355e:

    # c "It's the makeup. I'm still wearing my iconic eye-bags under here."
    c "是妆容的功劳。我那标志性的眼袋其实还藏在下面呢。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14266
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_65bbe4f3:

    # MC "You look great. It's really done a great job of making you look more alive."
    MC "你看起来很棒。这妆容确实让你显得更有生气了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14267
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_992aa437:

    # c "Mmm... I hate it."
    c "嗯……我讨厌这样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14268
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_62e1d2eb:

    # MC "You do?"
    MC "你感觉到了？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14269
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_52e0c89b:

    # c "It feels heavy... I thought you wouldn't feel it but you can."
    c "感觉很厚重……我以为你不会有感觉的，但你竟然能感觉到。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14270
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_1710c38f:

    # MC "Maybe you'll get used to it, like wearing glasses or something."
    MC "也许你会习惯的，就像戴眼镜那样。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14271
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_1dca3a86:

    # c "I don't want to... I hate all of this... I feel so fake. Dressing like this... the makeup. *Sigh*"
    c "我不想习惯……我讨厌这一切……我觉得自己好虚假。穿成这样……还有这妆容。*叹气*"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14272
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_fa6217e1:

    # MC "Oh... well... sorry you have to go through all of this."
    MC "噢……那个……真抱歉你得经历这些。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14273
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_935fe46c:

    # c "It's... no one's fault. And maybe once in a while wouldn't be too bad..."
    c "这……不怪任何人。而且偶尔来这么一次，其实也不坏……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14274
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_220407af:

    # c "I... still like it when mom and Grace all tell me how nice I look... and..."
    c "我……还是挺喜欢听妈妈和格蕾丝夸我好看的……还有……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14275
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_70a90612:

    # c "[size10small]You too..."
    c "[size10small]你也是……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14276
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14277
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_9d89e348:

    # c "Hey. Why are you squeezing me harder than earlier?"
    c "嘿，你抱得比刚才更紧了哦？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14278
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_1d7e5b00:

    # MC "A-am I? I dunno..."
    MC "是、是吗？我不知道……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14279
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_b84f7b5f:

    # c "*Yawn*"
    c "*哈欠*"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14280
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_cb2d52cd:

    # c "How much longer?"
    c "还要多久？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14281
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_8c48b7f3:

    # MC "Ninety minutes... give or take."
    MC "九十分钟……差不多吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14282
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_523c5bbf:

    # c "Is it... is it okay if I close my eyes for a moment?"
    c "那个……我可以闭目养神一会儿吗？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14283
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_4cb45238:

    # MC "Huh? Really? Right now?!"
    MC "嗯？真的吗？现在？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14284
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_f3d838f4:

    # c "Just a little bit... don't..."
    c "就一会儿……别……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14287
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_c69517e4:

    # c "Don't... leave me..."
    c "别……离开我……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14290
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_d9ebec3f:

    # MC "*Sigh*"
    MC "*叹气*"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14291
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_80b75473:

    # MC "I'll give you an hour."
    MC "我给你一个小时。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14292
translate schinese m23afterchoice8_d0a5785e:

    # c "[size10small]Mmhm..."
    c "[size10small]嗯……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14312
translate schinese m23montage_855fe2fd:

    # c "Mmm... I'm sleepy..."
    c "嗯……我好困……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14313
translate schinese m23montage_6b24f440:

    # MC "Like always..."
    MC "就像平时一样……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14314
translate schinese m23montage_6ecf0652:

    # c "Can you... keep me safe... I'm going to... close my eyes for a second... wake me up when it's time to go to Clement..."
    c "你能……保护我吗……我要……闭目养神一会儿……该去克莱门特的时候叫醒我……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14318
translate schinese m23montage_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14412
translate schinese m23montage_d9ebec3f:

    # MC "*Sigh*"
    MC "*叹气*"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14413
translate schinese m23montage_fea1a054:

    # MC "It's close enough... I guess it's time to get moving..."
    MC "时间差不多了……我想该出发了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14414
translate schinese m23montage_df4df115:

    # MC "Not that I want to..."
    MC "虽然我并不想……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14420
translate schinese m23montage_71f72ca7:

    # MC "Hey."
    MC "嘿。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14421
translate schinese m23montage_66e166c0:

    # MC "Hey, Chloe."
    MC "嘿，克洛伊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14422
translate schinese m23montage_e1e300f1:

    # MC "Come on, it's been long enough."
    MC "快点吧，时间够久了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14425
translate schinese m23montage_1f9e9ab9:

    # c "Mm-mmm..."
    c "嗯……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14426
translate schinese m23montage_39d2ca3b:

    # c "Already?"
    c "已经？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14429
translate schinese m23montage_3ffd6147:

    # c "Eeep! It's even colder now!"
    c "呀！现在更冷了！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14430
translate schinese m23montage_17427d2d:

    # c "*Shivers* Brr! Let's go, let's go! I don't wanna die out here!"
    c "*发抖* 嘶——！快走快走！我可不想死在这儿！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14437
translate schinese m23montage_47bc46f9:

    # a "Nghh!! It feels so good to finally kick back and take off this disguise."
    a "唔——！！终于能放松一下，脱掉这身伪装了，感觉真好。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14440
translate schinese m23montage_1990c1ae:

    # hu "Disguise?"
    hu "伪装？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14444
translate schinese m23montage_fa0c01a5:

    # hu "Ash?!"
    hu "阿什？！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14445
translate schinese m23montage_61768260:

    # a "Oh, wow, you remembered my name."
    a "哦，哇，你居然还记得我的名字。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14446
translate schinese m23montage_8474fef4:

    # hu "Tsk, this one at least..."
    hu "啧，至少这家伙……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14447
translate schinese m23montage_90ebc481:

    # hu "What the fuck are you doing here?"
    hu "你他妈在这儿干什么？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14450
translate schinese m23montage_51bd4cd2:

    # a "Just came to pick something up."
    a "只是来拿个东西。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14453
translate schinese m23montage_1823a3dd:

    # hu "!!!"
    hu "！！！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14466
translate schinese m23montage_b8e1c4a4:

    # a "Woah, woah, woah! You don't need to do that! I'm not here to fight! Not that I'd stand a chance against you anyway."
    a "等等、等等、等等！没必要那样！我不是来打架的！再说，我也根本打不过你啊。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14467
translate schinese m23montage_3f9ab1af:

    # a "I promise, I'm not back with them, this is for me and me alone!"
    a "我保证，我没跟他们混在一起，这完全是我个人的事！"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14468
translate schinese m23montage_76f74731:

    # a "So you could maybe keep your sword tucked away? I'm rather attached to my beautiful face."
    a "能不能把你的剑收起来？我挺爱惜我这张漂亮脸蛋的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14470
translate schinese m23montage_eba97928:

    # hu "..."
    hu "……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14476
translate schinese m23montage_41c96dd3:

    # hu "...So?"
    hu "……所以呢？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14477
translate schinese m23montage_6f1aa232:

    # hu "What's the point of tricking me, bringing me here, and gloating in my face?"
    hu "费尽心思把我骗到这儿，然后当面炫耀，这到底有什么意义？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14478
translate schinese m23montage_844f657c:

    # a "Oh, that? Uh... I dug a hole for myself and peer pressure prevented me from climbing back out of it."
    a "噢，那个啊？呃……我给自己挖了个坑，结果碍于同伴的压力，想爬都爬不出来了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14479
translate schinese m23montage_882f1824:

    # hu "Spell it out for me."
    hu "把话给我说清楚点。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14480
translate schinese m23montage_e5f9269a:

    # a "*Sigh* I brought a few friends here, they're a little... hmm... out of the loop. I think it would be harder to get them {i}in{/i} the loop, to be honest."
    a "*叹气* 我带了几个朋友过来，他们有点……嗯……状况外。老实说，想让他们搞清楚状况恐怕比什么都难。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14483
translate schinese m23montage_d1f16957:

    # a "I told them I was here on a revenge mission, sold them a sob story about being bullied by you, being made fun of for my androgyny, being called a faggot and a princess."
    a "我告诉他们我是来寻仇的，还编了个惨兮兮的故事：说我被你欺负，因为中性的外表被嘲笑，还被骂作“死基佬”和“公主病”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14484
translate schinese m23montage_838c7a74:

    # a "Unfortunately, they were more on board with the idea than I anticipated, and far too competent as well."
    a "糟糕的是，他们对这个主意的热衷程度远超我的预期，而且……他们的行动力也强得过头了。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14485
translate schinese m23montage_19a4e1d8:

    # a "I had to keep the act up all night, leading to this silly plan that's led to us here. In this room."
    a "我不得不硬着头皮把戏演了一整晚，结果就搞出了这么个荒唐的计划，把我们带到了这里——带到了这个房间里。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14486
translate schinese m23montage_c0be75e3:

    # a "If everything went my way, we would've never even spoken, and I could've chalked it up as a failure, maybe shed some crocodile tears. I'm quite good at that."
    a "如果一切按我的剧本走，我们根本就不会有交集，我也能把这事归结为一次失败，顶多再挤出几滴鳄鱼的眼泪——毕竟，我可是很擅长演那一套的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14487
translate schinese m23montage_8c451184:

    # a "Still, I got what I wanted. Had to throw a firecracker at my friends so they wouldn't see me swipe it, but it mostly worked out in the end."
    a "不过，我还是得偿所愿了。当时我不得不朝朋友们扔了个鞭炮，好让他们没法看见我顺手牵羊，但结果还算顺利。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14488
translate schinese m23montage_79a6593b:

    # hu "Umm..."
    hu "呃……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14491
translate schinese m23montage_049d91ff:

    # hu "But I {i}did{/i} bully you and call you a faggot."
    hu "但我{i}确实{/i}欺负过你，还骂你是死基佬。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14493
translate schinese m23montage_e4755d6e:

    # a "Yeah, well, I ain't no bitch."
    a "是啊，不过，我可不是什么软蛋。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14494
translate schinese m23montage_104cc440:

    # a "Seriously, though, that shit was cruel. You should be ashamed of yourself. You could've seriously fucked up someone with a weaker will than mine."
    a "说真的，那事儿做得太恶毒了。你应该感到羞愧。要是换个意志力没我这么强的人，真可能会被你彻底毁掉的。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14497
translate schinese m23montage_a3b3bdd3:

    # hu "*Tsk* I {i}was{/i} ashamed. Fuck you. Don't you remember? I tried my best to undo what I did."
    hu "*啧*，我{i}当时{/i}确实感到羞愧。去你的。你不记得了吗？我可是尽了全力去弥补自己犯下的错。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14498
translate schinese m23montage_9253a292:

    # a "Hmm? Yeah, I guess. Your profound lack of charisma really nulls the sincerity of your apologies, though."
    a "嗯？是啊，大概吧。不过，你那极度缺乏魅力的样子，真让你的道歉显得毫无诚意。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14499
translate schinese m23montage_7ca5a0c4:

    # a "Glad to see you're still as charming as ever."
    a "很高兴看到你还是像以前一样“迷人”。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14500
translate schinese m23montage_cf002ab6:

    # hu "*Sigh* And you? Stringing along a band of fools?"
    hu "*叹气* 那你呢？还在带着一群蠢货瞎混？"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14504
translate schinese m23montage_e1e2811e:

    # a "Oi."
    a "喂。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14505
translate schinese m23montage_bf2edd40:

    # a "Hold your tongue."
    a "把嘴闭上。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14506
translate schinese m23montage_713f7094:

    # a "I lied to, and manipulated, several close friends of mine. Friends I hold {i}very{/i} dearly."
    a "我欺骗并操纵了几个挚友。那些我{i}非常{/i}珍视的朋友。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14507
translate schinese m23montage_8a7e290e:

    # a "Do {i}not{/i} think I made the decision lightly. And don't you {b}dare{/b} imply that I'm using them."
    a "别以为我{i}不是{/i}轻率地做出那个决定。也{b}别{/b}暗示我在利用他们。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14508
translate schinese m23montage_a0e60553:

    # a "Now. May. I. Leave."
    a "好了。我。可。以。走。了。吗。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14511
translate schinese m23montage_a4d70af2:

    # hu "...I see I struck a nerve."
    hu "……看来我戳到了你的痛处。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14512
translate schinese m23montage_af302678:

    # hu "Fine. You got what you wanted. Consider this my final apology."
    hu "好吧。你如愿以偿了。就把这当作我最后的道歉吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14513
translate schinese m23montage_915fb24e:

    # hu "You need to leave. Immediately. No detours, straight to the exit."
    hu "你得离开。立刻。别绕路，直接去出口。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14516
translate schinese m23montage_cbb3510b:

    # ath "Mmm... I really need to give Grace her dress back..."
    ath "唔……我真的得把那件礼服还给格蕾丝了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14517
translate schinese m23montage_841a30d8:

    # ath "That sucks... I'll have to send out a text and let them figure it out..."
    ath "真糟糕……我得发条信息，让他们自己想办法了……"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14518
translate schinese m23montage_0e1769f3:

    # a "Fine."
    a "很好。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14519
translate schinese m23montage_3fbab050:

    # a "Though I still have one more point of business I need to attend with you."
    a "不过，我还有一件事需要和你处理。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14520
translate schinese m23montage_d529179d:

    # hu "Oh? By all means, surprise me."
    hu "哦？请便，给我个惊喜吧。"

# game/script2_2.rpyc:14521
translate schinese m23montage_9fe74a56:

    # a "You're going to regret saying that."
    a "你会后悔说出这句话的。"

